e":1423949601,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b197079d6281c5ad31cfec9d11edd19a","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;This is the new OFFICIAL Gran Bahia Principe Riviera Maya Thread!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Here you will find the answer to almost all of your questions!&amp;nbsp; If you don&#039;t see the answer, feel free to ask, but please look through the information first. &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/75549\/official-gran-bahia-principe-riviera-maya-thread#post_1663888&#039;&gt;Post #2&lt;\/a&gt; - Basic Information (Resort Info, Contact Info, Legal Requirements)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/75549\/official-gran-bahia-principe-riviera-maya-thread#post_1663889&#039;&gt;Post #3&lt;\/a&gt; - Wedding Packages&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/75549\/official-gran-bahia-principe-riviera-maya-thread#post_1663891&#039;&gt;Post #4&lt;\/a&gt; - Wedding Locations&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/75549\/official-gran-bahia-principe-riviera-maya-thread#post_1663892&#039;&gt;Post #5&lt;\/a&gt; - Dinner Locations, Options &amp;amp; Cost&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/75549\/official-gran-bahia-principe-riviera-maya-thread#post_1663893&#039;&gt;Post #6&lt;\/a&gt; - DJ Options and Costs&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/75549\/official-gran-bahia-principe-riviera-maya-thread#post_1663894&#039;&gt;Post #7&lt;\/a&gt; - Cake&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/75549\/official-gran-bahia-principe-riviera-maya-thread#post_1663895&#039;&gt;Post #8&lt;\/a&gt; - Details (ceremony details, hacienda stuff, random questions and answers)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/75549\/official-gran-bahia-principe-riviera-maya-thread#post_1663896&#039;&gt;Post #9&lt;\/a&gt; - Flowers&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/75549\/official-gran-bahia-principe-riviera-maya-thread#post_1663897&#039;&gt;Post #10&lt;\/a&gt; - Spa&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/75549\/official-gran-bahia-principe-riviera-maya-thread\/10#post_1663898&#039;&gt;Post #11&lt;\/a&gt; - Tropic One Studio (the onsite photographers)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/75549\/official-gran-bahia-principe-riviera-maya-thread\/10#post_1663899&#039;&gt;Post #12&lt;\/a&gt; - Wedding Reviews&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/75549\/official-gran-bahia-principe-riviera-maya-thread\/10#post_1663900&#039;&gt;Post #13&lt;\/a&gt; - Wedding Photos &amp;amp; Video Links&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/75549\/official-gran-bahia-principe-riviera-maya-thread\/10#post_1663901&#039;&gt;Post #14&lt;\/a&gt; - Resort Reviews&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/75549\/official-gran-bahia-principe-riviera-maya-thread\/10#post_1663902&#039;&gt;Post #15&lt;\/a&gt; - Bride Roll Call!&amp;nbsp; Shoot me a PM with your user name, wedding date, and dates you&#039;ll be at the resort (ie: tlseege, 4\/11\/2008, 4\/7-4\/14) and I&#039;ll add you to the list&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/75549\/official-gran-bahia-principe-riviera-maya-thread\/10#post_1663903&#039;&gt;Post #16&lt;\/a&gt; - Faber Photography&#039;s Photo Tours&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/75549\/official-gran-bahia-principe-riviera-maya-thread\/10#post_1663904&#039;&gt;Post #17&lt;\/a&gt; - Reserved for future use &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Again, if you have anything to add to this, please feel free to send me a PM or shoot me an email and I will gladly update the thread.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp; The old &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/786\/gran-bahia-principe-akumal-tulum-coba-post-here&#039;&gt;Gran Bahia Thread&lt;\/a&gt; is still alive and active, but hopefully that thread will be more for brides to discuss their weddings and form a sense of community. &amp;nbsp; Thanks!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1514319,"PostDate":1314972856,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>This is the new OFFICIAL Gran Bahia Principe Riviera Maya Thread!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Here you will find the answer to almost all of your questions!\u00a0 If you don't see the answer, feel free to ask, but please look through the information first. \u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/75549\/official-gran-bahia-principe-riviera-maya-thread#post_1663888' class='bbc_url' title=''>Post #2<\/a> - Basic Information (Resort Info, Contact Info, Legal Requirements)<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/75549\/official-gran-bahia-principe-riviera-maya-thread#post_1663889' class='bbc_url' title=''>Post #3<\/a> - Wedding Packages<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/75549\/official-gran-bahia-principe-riviera-maya-thread#post_1663891' class='bbc_url' title=''>Post #4<\/a> - Wedding Locations<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/75549\/official-gran-bahia-principe-riviera-maya-thread#post_1663892' class='bbc_url' title=''>Post #5<\/a> - Dinner Locations, Options & Cost<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/75549\/official-gran-bahia-principe-riviera-maya-thread#post_1663893' class='bbc_url' title=''>Post #6<\/a> - DJ Options and Costs<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/75549\/official-gran-bahia-principe-riviera-maya-thread#post_1663894' class='bbc_url' title=''>Post #7<\/a> - Cake<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/75549\/official-gran-bahia-principe-riviera-maya-thread#post_1663895' class='bbc_url' title=''>Post #8<\/a> - Details (ceremony details, hacienda stuff, random questions and answers)<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/75549\/official-gran-bahia-principe-riviera-maya-thread#post_1663896' class='bbc_url' title=''>Post #9<\/a> - Flowers<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/75549\/official-gran-bahia-principe-riviera-maya-thread#post_1663897' class='bbc_url' title=''>Post #10<\/a> - Spa<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/75549\/official-gran-bahia-principe-riviera-maya-thread\/10#post_1663898' class='bbc_url' title=''>Post #11<\/a> - Tropic One Studio (the onsite photographers)<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/75549\/official-gran-bahia-principe-riviera-maya-thread\/10#post_1663899' class='bbc_url' title=''>Post #12<\/a> - Wedding Reviews<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/75549\/official-gran-bahia-principe-riviera-maya-thread\/10#post_1663900' class='bbc_url' title=''>Post #13<\/a> - Wedding Photos & Video Links<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/75549\/official-gran-bahia-principe-riviera-maya-thread\/10#post_1663901' class='bbc_url' title=''>Post #14<\/a> - Resort Reviews<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/75549\/official-gran-bahia-principe-riviera-maya-thread\/10#post_1663902' class='bbc_url' title=''>Post #15<\/a> - Bride Roll Call!\u00a0 Shoot me a PM with your user name, wedding date, and dates you'll be at the resort (ie: tlseege, 4\/11\/2008, 4\/7-4\/14) and I'll add you to the list<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/75549\/official-gran-bahia-principe-riviera-maya-thread\/10#post_1663903' class='bbc_url' title=''>Post #16<\/a> - Faber Photography's Photo Tours<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/75549\/official-gran-bahia-principe-riviera-maya-thread\/10#post_1663904' class='bbc_url' title=''>Post #17<\/a> - Reserved for future use \u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Again, if you have anything to add to this, please feel free to send me a PM or shoot me an email and I will gladly update the thread.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0 The old <a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/786\/gran-bahia-principe-akumal-tulum-coba-post-here' class='bbc_url' title=''>Gran Bahia Thread<\/a> is still alive and active, but hopefully that thread will be more for brides to discuss their weddings and form a sense of community. \u00a0 Thanks!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"~Trisha~<br \/>\n<a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.faberphotography.com'>www.faberphotography.com<\/a><br \/>\n<br \/>\nMy latest destination wedding photos can be found <a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/faberphotography.com\/destination-wedding\/'>HERE<\/a>","Email":"tfaber@wbmi.com","IpAddress":"12.24.226.126","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1172009700,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207201.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Tlseege","Id":207201,"Name":"Tlseege","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":63282,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1435262520,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5d3bde3d1ed275572f55f9ae412ebb4b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bahia-principe.com\/BP\/Resorts\/Resort\/Bodas\/Akumal&#039;&gt;The Resort Website&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/pinterest.com\/bahiaprincipe\/caribbean-weddings\/&#039;&gt;Resort&#039;s wedding Pinterest website&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Overall Coordinator is Ms. Paloma Flores \/ Groups &amp;amp; Convention Manager&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;mailto:pflores@tulum.bahia-principe.com&#039;&gt;pflores@tulum.bahia-principe.com&lt;\/a&gt; or &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;mailto:groupsmx@bahia-principe.com&#039;&gt;groupsmx@bahia-principe.com&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Tel: 052 984 87 5 50 00 Ext. 28117 \u00b7 Fax: 052 984 87 5 50 01&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Maps of the Resort:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/532516\/width\/350\/height\/700\" alt=\"700\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Here is a new 2011 map of the resort, including the golf facility across the road.&amp;nbsp; To view it zoomed, go &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/75549\/official-gran-bahia-principe-riviera-maya-thread\/50#post_1696371&#039;&gt;HERE&lt;\/a&gt;.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/589575\/width\/600\/height\/450\" alt=\"450\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.locogringo.com\/maps\/tour\/bahia-p-t.html&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.locogringo.com\/maps\/tour\/bahia-p-t.html&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/786\/gran-bahia-principe-akumal-tulum-coba-post-here\/1890#post_1001258&#039;&gt;Post # 1897&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Tulum&lt;\/u&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Tulum was the first hotel of the complex with 858 rooms, only 84 junior suites and the rest of them standard rooms&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Wedding Coordinator is Jazmin - &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;mailto:grupostulum@tulum.bahia-principe.com&#039;&gt;grupostulum@tulum.bahia-principe.com&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Wedding Sites: Beach, Gazebo&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Wedding Dinner Choices: Tequila or Gran Tortuga&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Akumal&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/u&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Akumal was the second in built with 630 rooms, 72 standard and 558 junior suites&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Wedding sites:&amp;nbsp; Hammocks, Garden&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Rain location:&amp;nbsp; Akumal Lobby Bar, Club Coba (deceiving name, as it\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s actually in the basement of the Akumal Lobby)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Wedding Dinner choices: Dolce Vita (Italian) and Frutos Del Mar (Fish)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Coba&lt;\/u&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Coba the last one built with 1080 rooms all junior suites&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Wedding sites: Choice between Akumal and Tulum locations&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Wedding Coordinator - Karla &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;mailto:groupmx3@bahia-principe.com&#039;&gt;groupmx3@bahia-principe.com&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/786\/gran-bahia-principe-akumal-tulum-coba-post-here\/2230#post_1092530&#039;&gt;Post #2238 - Distance to beach\/Akumal area\/etc&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/786\/gran-bahia-principe-akumal-tulum-coba-post-here\/70#post_166597&#039;&gt;Wedding Applications you&#039;ll be asked to fill out.&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/786\/gran-bahia-principe-akumal-tulum-coba-post-here\/150#post_240868&#039;&gt;Welcome Packet from a previous bride&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Day Passes are $90 USD for guests who aren&#039;t staying at the hotel&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Hair &amp;amp; Makeup Day Passes are $300 USD&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Local outside photographers are NOT allowed, however you can fly in your photographer and have them stay at the resort as a guest.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Legal Requirements:&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Below you can find all required documents to celebrate a legal wedding in Mexico, there are different options according to the different needs due to special circumstances.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Option 1:&lt;\/strong&gt; Marriage certificate WITHOUT parents name in it AND with the actual full name that appear in valid passport (Basic documentation required with single status of Bride &amp;amp; Groom)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- VALID PASSPORT \u2013 (Bride, Groom &amp;amp; 4 witnesses over 18 years old)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- BLOOD TESTS \u2013 (Bride &amp;amp; Groom) In Mexico Blood Tests for a legal wedding are mandatory, these are to determine blood type and also to check for HIV or STD\u2019s. Tests must be done on site. Bahia Principe has a medical center located at the Hacienda Do\u00f1a Isabel, which provides this service with a cost of $95 USD per person (cash).&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Option 2:&lt;\/strong&gt; Marriage Certificate WITH parents name in it: In case the wedding couple want their parents name to appear in the marriage certificate, the following documentation is required:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;*Please verify your parents name appears in the Certify copy of birth certificate (Long version)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- NOTARIZED COPY OF BIRTH CERTIFICATE (Bride &amp;amp; Groom) \u2013 Apostilled AND the translation into Spanish Apostilled too *Please notice this documents will remain with the Judge in Mexico&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- VALID PASSPORT - (Bride, Groom &amp;amp; 4 witnesses over 18 years old)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- BLOOD TESTS \u2013 (Bride &amp;amp; Groom)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SPECIAL CIRCUMSTANCES:&lt;\/strong&gt; If the Bride or Groom has changed their last names for any reason, so that the name that appears on the passport is not the same name as on the birth certificate, (due to different reasons e.g. divorce, widowed, adoption, legal change of name, etc.) please consider the following requirements :&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- NOTARIZED COPY OF BIRTH CERTIFICATE (Bride &amp;amp; Groom) \u2013 Apostilled AND the translation into Spanish Apostilled too *Please notice this documents will remain with the Judge in Mexico&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- VALID PASSPORT - (Bride, Groom &amp;amp; 4 witnesses over 18 years old)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- BLOOD TESTS \u2013 (Bride &amp;amp; Groom)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;MORE SPECIAL CIRCUMSTANCES:&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;If Bride or Groom or both are divorced from a previous marriage&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Notarized Decree absolute - Apostilled AND the translation into Spanish Apostilled too *Please notice this documents will remain with the Judge in Mexico&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;If Bride or Groom are widowed&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Notarized Deceased Decree absolute - Apostilled AND the translation into Spanish Apostilled too *Please notice this documents will remain with the Judge in Mexico&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;If Bride or Groom are adopted&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Notarized Adoption certificate- Apostilled AND the translation into Spanish Apostilled too *Please notice this documents will remain with the Judge in Mexico&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;CANADIAN CITIZEN \u2013 APOSTILLED MEANS LEGALIZED BY A LEGAL OFFICIAL TRANSLATOR IN CANADA.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/786\/gran-bahia-principe-akumal-tulum-coba-post-here\/1940#post_1007105&#039;&gt;Post #1945 - It&#039;s really THAT easy!&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;UK Legal Requirements (updated 8\/17\/2012):&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Deed Poll (if you have changed your name)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Adoption Certificate (even if only adopted by step father\/mother)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Birth Certificates (even from the person who has an adoption certificate).&amp;nbsp;In the UK (not sure about other countries) the adoption certificate super seeds the birth certificate... this means that the birth certificate can not be used for any legal &amp;nbsp;purpose.. But the Mexican authorities require it... the general registry office in London is very reluctant to produce on of these, but will in the end.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ADDITIONAL INFORMATION &amp;amp; CONDITIONS:&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Bride, Groom and all official witnesses must be over 18 years old.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- In order to review all this specific and required documentation with the Judge, it is extremely important that you scan the requested information and send it to us with a &lt;strong&gt;minimum of 3 months previous to the wedding day.&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Wedding couple must arrive 4 business days prior to the wedding day with all necessary documents, in order to complete blood tests and legal procedures. (Please note Saturday &amp;amp; Sunday is not considered a business day)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Witnesses can be friends or family, Bahia Principe can also provide the witnesses ( suggested tip $10 USD per witness)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ala Carte Information:&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;If guests stays for 4 or 7 nights how many nights can they eat at the a la cart restaurant?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;3 or 4 nights 1 dinner&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;5 or 6 nights 2 dinners&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;7 or 9 nights 3 dinners&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;If you take the dinner included in the wedding package, that counts as one of your guests ala carte meals.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Random Information:&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;The bars located by the pool and beach area close at 5:00 pm , bars located in the lobby from 10 am till 11:00 pm Music Bar from 6:30 pm till 10:30 pm , Bars located at Hacienda Do\u00b1a Isabel from 7:00 pm till midnight and Disco from midnight till 2:00 am&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Everything is paid for at the end of your stay, and they do accept credit cards. (Except the blood work, that is in cash at the time of your appointment)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;The internet access is at the Hacienda so you have to pay in cash (it can&#039;t be charged to the room - I don&#039;t think). I used it once for under 10 minutes and I think it was close to $7-8 (so about $1\/min). I don&#039;t remember exactly though. I paid in USD but they take pesos too.&amp;nbsp; Diamond club members get free internet access in the lobby.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Brides and Grooms are given Gold bracelets, my family all were \"Gold class\" but got yellow bracelets. As it was explained to us, actual gold bracelets are VIP. They do not keep track of your a la cartes.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Rehearsals aren\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t done at this resort.&amp;nbsp; But the coordinators will not let you screw up.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Legal ceremonies cannot be altered and must be read in Spanish and translated to English.&amp;nbsp; You can add readings or sand ceremony type items after the legal portion has been completed.&amp;nbsp; This can either be read by the translator or a guest.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/786\/gran-bahia-principe-akumal-tulum-coba-post-here\/1360#post_743274&#039;&gt;Here is a post where some additional random questions are answered&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/786\/gran-bahia-principe-akumal-tulum-coba-post-here\/1360#post_743274&#039;&gt;Here too.&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Hotel safe = $6 extra a day.&amp;nbsp; Some people have gotten this as a perk, some people haven&#039;t.&amp;nbsp; Just be prepared to pay it and be pleasantly surprised if you don&#039;t have to.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Mosquitoes in October\/November&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;All three resorts now use key cards instead of traditional keys.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Hurricane Information:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;In 2011 Tropical Storm Rina hit the Gran Bahia.&amp;nbsp; In the days leading up to landfall it was a Hurricane 2 and then a 1.&amp;nbsp; One of our brides was visiting the resort at this time has reported back:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;\"I have never been exposed to really bad weather there and have to say the Bahia kept us well informed about the path of the storm and how that would affect the hotel and guests. They prepared for the worst but it ended up being not too bad. They pulled the hurricane shutters, evacuated Building 66 at Akumal (right on the beach), removed all lounge chairs from the beach and pool areas, removed signage\/garbage cans etc that could be blown around or damaged.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;They removed strips of thatching from the Grand Tortuga roof to allow the wind to blow through...and then repaired it when the storm passed.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;They did the same thing with the Premier Lobby bordering Coba and Akumal. It was good to experience how they handle such weather\/storms...I always felt safe and well informed.\"&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1514320,"PostDate":1314972867,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p><a href='http:\/\/www.bahia-principe.com\/BP\/Resorts\/Resort\/Bodas\/Akumal' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>The Resort Website<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/pinterest.com\/bahiaprincipe\/caribbean-weddings\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Resort's wedding Pinterest website<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Overall Coordinator is Ms. Paloma Flores \/ Groups & Convention Manager<\/p>\n<p><a href='mailto:pflores@tulum.bahia-principe.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>pflores@tulum.bahia-principe.com<\/a> or <a href='mailto:groupsmx@bahia-principe.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>groupsmx@bahia-principe.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Tel: 052 984 87 5 50 00 Ext. 28117 \u00b7 Fax: 052 984 87 5 50 01<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Maps of the Resort:<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/532516\/width\/350\/height\/700\" alt=\"700\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>Here is a new 2011 map of the resort, including the golf facility across the road.\u00a0 To view it zoomed, go <a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/75549\/official-gran-bahia-principe-riviera-maya-thread\/50#post_1696371' class='bbc_url' title=''>HERE<\/a>.<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/589575\/width\/600\/height\/450\" alt=\"450\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.locogringo.com\/maps\/tour\/bahia-p-t.html' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.locogring...\/bahia-p-t.html<\/a><\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/786\/gran-bahia-principe-akumal-tulum-coba-post-here\/1890#post_1001258' class='bbc_url' title=''>Post # 1897<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong><u>Tulum<\/u><\/strong><\/p>\n<p>Tulum was the first hotel of the complex with 858 rooms, only 84 junior suites and the rest of them standard rooms<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Coordinator is Jazmin - <a href='mailto:grupostulum@tulum.bahia-principe.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>grupostulum@tulum.bahia-principe.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Wedding Sites: Beach, Gazebo<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Dinner Choices: Tequila or Gran Tortuga<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><u><strong>Akumal<\/strong><\/u><\/p>\n<p>Akumal was the second in built with 630 rooms, 72 standard and 558 junior suites<\/p>\n<p>Wedding sites:\u00a0 Hammocks, Garden<\/p>\n<p>Rain location:\u00a0 Akumal Lobby Bar, Club Coba (deceiving name, as it\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s actually in the basement of the Akumal Lobby)<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Dinner choices: Dolce Vita (Italian) and Frutos Del Mar (Fish)<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong><u>Coba<\/u><\/strong><\/p>\n<p>Coba the last one built with 1080 rooms all junior suites<\/p>\n<p>Wedding sites: Choice between Akumal and Tulum locations<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Coordinator - Karla <a href='mailto:groupmx3@bahia-principe.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>groupmx3@bahia-principe.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/786\/gran-bahia-principe-akumal-tulum-coba-post-here\/2230#post_1092530' class='bbc_url' title=''>Post #2238 - Distance to beach\/Akumal area\/etc<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/786\/gran-bahia-principe-akumal-tulum-coba-post-here\/70#post_166597' class='bbc_url' title=''>Wedding Applications you'll be asked to fill out.<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/786\/gran-bahia-principe-akumal-tulum-coba-post-here\/150#post_240868' class='bbc_url' title=''>Welcome Packet from a previous bride<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Day Passes are $90 USD for guests who aren't staying at the hotel<\/p>\n<p>Hair & Makeup Day Passes are $300 USD<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Local outside photographers are NOT allowed, however you can fly in your photographer and have them stay at the resort as a guest.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>Legal Requirements:<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>Below you can find all required documents to celebrate a legal wedding in Mexico, there are different options according to the different needs due to special circumstances.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>Option 1:<\/strong> Marriage certificate WITHOUT parents name in it AND with the actual full name that appear in valid passport (Basic documentation required with single status of Bride & Groom)<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0- VALID PASSPORT \u2013 (Bride, Groom & 4 witnesses over 18 years old)<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0- BLOOD TESTS \u2013 (Bride & Groom) In Mexico Blood Tests for a legal wedding are mandatory, these are to determine blood type and also to check for HIV or STD\u2019s. Tests must be done on site. Bahia Principe has a medical center located at the Hacienda Do\u00f1a Isabel, which provides this service with a cost of $95 USD per person (cash).<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>Option 2:<\/strong> Marriage Certificate WITH parents name in it: In case the wedding couple want their parents name to appear in the marriage certificate, the following documentation is required:<\/p>\n<p>*Please verify your parents name appears in the Certify copy of birth certificate (Long version)<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0- NOTARIZED COPY OF BIRTH CERTIFICATE (Bride & Groom) \u2013 Apostilled AND the translation into Spanish Apostilled too *Please notice this documents will remain with the Judge in Mexico<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0- VALID PASSPORT - (Bride, Groom & 4 witnesses over 18 years old)<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0- BLOOD TESTS \u2013 (Bride & Groom)<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>SPECIAL CIRCUMSTANCES:<\/strong> If the Bride or Groom has changed their last names for any reason, so that the name that appears on the passport is not the same name as on the birth certificate, (due to different reasons e.g. divorce, widowed, adoption, legal change of name, etc.) please consider the following requirements :<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0- NOTARIZED COPY OF BIRTH CERTIFICATE (Bride & Groom) \u2013 Apostilled AND the translation into Spanish Apostilled too *Please notice this documents will remain with the Judge in Mexico<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0- VALID PASSPORT - (Bride, Groom & 4 witnesses over 18 years old)<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0- BLOOD TESTS \u2013 (Bride & Groom)<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>MORE SPECIAL CIRCUMSTANCES:<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>If Bride or Groom or both are divorced from a previous marriage<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0- Notarized Decree absolute - Apostilled AND the translation into Spanish Apostilled too *Please notice this documents will remain with the Judge in Mexico<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>If Bride or Groom are widowed<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0- Notarized Deceased Decree absolute - Apostilled AND the translation into Spanish Apostilled too *Please notice this documents will remain with the Judge in Mexico<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>If Bride or Groom are adopted<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0- Notarized Adoption certificate- Apostilled AND the translation into Spanish Apostilled too *Please notice this documents will remain with the Judge in Mexico<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>CANADIAN CITIZEN \u2013 APOSTILLED MEANS LEGALIZED BY A LEGAL OFFICIAL TRANSLATOR IN CANADA.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/786\/gran-bahia-principe-akumal-tulum-coba-post-here\/1940#post_1007105' class='bbc_url' title=''>Post #1945 - It's really THAT easy!<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>UK Legal Requirements (updated 8\/17\/2012):<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>Deed Poll (if you have changed your name)<\/p>\n<p>Adoption Certificate (even if only adopted by step father\/mother)<\/p>\n<p>Birth Certificates (even from the person who has an adoption certificate).\u00a0In the UK (not sure about other countries) the adoption certificate super seeds the birth certificate... this means that the birth certificate can not be used for any legal \u00a0purpose.. But the Mexican authorities require it... the general registry office in London is very reluctant to produce on of these, but will in the end.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>ADDITIONAL INFORMATION & CONDITIONS:<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0- Bride, Groom and all official witnesses must be over 18 years old.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0- In order to review all this specific and required documentation with the Judge, it is extremely important that you scan the requested information and send it to us with a <strong>minimum of 3 months previous to the wedding day.<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0- Wedding couple must arrive 4 business days prior to the wedding day with all necessary documents, in order to complete blood tests and legal procedures. (Please note Saturday & Sunday is not considered a business day)<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0- Witnesses can be friends or family, Bahia Principe can also provide the witnesses ( suggested tip $10 USD per witness)<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>Ala Carte Information:<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>If guests stays for 4 or 7 nights how many nights can they eat at the a la cart restaurant?<\/p>\n<p>3 or 4 nights 1 dinner<\/p>\n<p>5 or 6 nights 2 dinners<\/p>\n<p>7 or 9 nights 3 dinners<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>If you take the dinner included in the wedding package, that counts as one of your guests ala carte meals.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>Random Information:<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>The bars located by the pool and beach area close at 5:00 pm , bars located in the lobby from 10 am till 11:00 pm Music Bar from 6:30 pm till 10:30 pm , Bars located at Hacienda Do\u00b1a Isabel from 7:00 pm till midnight and Disco from midnight till 2:00 am<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Everything is paid for at the end of your stay, and they do accept credit cards. (Except the blood work, that is in cash at the time of your appointment)<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>The internet access is at the Hacienda so you have to pay in cash (it can't be charged to the room - I don't think). I used it once for under 10 minutes and I think it was close to $7-8 (so about $1\/min). I don't remember exactly though. I paid in USD but they take pesos too.\u00a0 Diamond club members get free internet access in the lobby.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Brides and Grooms are given Gold bracelets, my family all were \"Gold class\" but got yellow bracelets. As it was explained to us, actual gold bracelets are VIP. They do not keep track of your a la cartes.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Rehearsals aren\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t done at this resort.\u00a0 But the coordinators will not let you screw up.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Legal ceremonies cannot be altered and must be read in Spanish and translated to English.\u00a0 You can add readings or sand ceremony type items after the legal portion has been completed.\u00a0 This can either be read by the translator or a guest.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/786\/gran-bahia-principe-akumal-tulum-coba-post-here\/1360#post_743274' class='bbc_url' title=''>Here is a post where some additional random questions are answered<\/a><\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/786\/gran-bahia-principe-akumal-tulum-coba-post-here\/1360#post_743274' class='bbc_url' title=''>Here too.<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Hotel safe = $6 extra a day.\u00a0 Some people have gotten this as a perk, some people haven't.\u00a0 Just be prepared to pay it and be pleasantly surprised if you don't have to.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Mosquitoes in October\/November<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>All three resorts now use key cards instead of traditional keys.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Hurricane Information:<\/p>\n<p>In 2011 Tropical Storm Rina hit the Gran Bahia.\u00a0 In the days leading up to landfall it was a Hurricane 2 and then a 1.\u00a0 One of our brides was visiting the resort at this time has reported back:<\/p>\n<p>\"I have never been exposed to really bad weather there and have to say the Bahia kept us well informed about the path of the storm and how that would affect the hotel and guests. They prepared for the worst but it ended up being not too bad. They pulled the hurricane shutters, evacuated Building 66 at Akumal (right on the beach), removed all lounge chairs from the beach and pool areas, removed signage\/garbage cans etc that could be blown around or damaged.<\/p>\n<p>They removed strips of thatching from the Grand Tortuga roof to allow the wind to blow through...and then repaired it when the storm passed.<\/p>\n<p>They did the same thing with the Premier Lobby bordering Coba and Akumal. It was good to experience how they handle such weather\/storms...I always felt safe and well informed.\"<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"~Trisha~<br \/>\n<a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.faberphotography.com'>www.faberphotography.com<\/a><br \/>\n<br \/>\nMy latest destination wedding photos can be found <a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/faberphotography.com\/destination-wedding\/'>HERE<\/a>","Email":"tfaber@wbmi.com","IpAddress":"12.24.226.126","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1172009700,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207201.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Tlseege","Id":207201,"Name":"Tlseege","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":63282,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1435262141,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"40c5853b8a64373a9975d3460ae8341f","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wedding Packages 2015&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/u&gt;.&amp;nbsp; If you are sent a more up to date version, please PM me.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/786\/gran-bahia-principe-akumal-tulum-coba-post-here\/2330#post_1124798&#039;&gt;Post #2333&lt;\/a&gt; has the Civil Ceremony Order&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SUNSHINE - Tulum &amp;amp; Coba - $1,570 (Legal) $1,395 (Symbolic) Akumal&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;amp; Sian Kaan&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;$1,690 (Legal) $1,515 (Symbolic)&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;- Winter 2014\/15 Maximum 20 people.&amp;nbsp; $25 each additional guest&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Late check out (subject to availability) for the couple and parents.&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Room upgrade (subject to availability upon arrival) for the couple and parents.&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;VIP Amenities in the room.&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Professional Services of an Onsite Wedding Planner&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Romantic Ornamental decoration of the wedding site (location assigned after arrival).&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Standard wedding cake or variety of Chef\u00b4s customs pastry dessert choice&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Celebration Toast (Domestic Brand) after the ceremony .&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Music for the marriage ceremony with recorded CD (couple may bring their own).&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Professional digital pictures of the Wedding full color photograph**. 10 Pictures&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Witnesses (if required)&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Bride\u2019s bouquet (Tropical Local Flowers)&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Groom\u2019s boutonniere&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;15% Discount on Spa Treatments (except pedicure, manicure, hairdresser and makeup).&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Sit-Down Wedding reception Dinner in one of our restaurants with set menu.&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Romantic decoration in couple room&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Luxury Turndown service for the couple and parents.&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Special welcome surprise&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Bottle of domestic wine upon arrival in room (just for the couple)&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Newlywed\u00b4s Romantic Breakfast in bed the morning after the wedding&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;VIP Treatment for the couple&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;\/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#333333;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:small;\"&gt;UNFORGETTABLE&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;Tulum &amp;amp; Coba -&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#333333;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:small;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;$1,840 (Legal) $1,665 (Symbolic)&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Akumal &amp;amp; Sian Kaan -&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:small;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;$1,990 (Legal) $1,815 (Symbolic)&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Winter 2014\/15 Maximum 30 people.&amp;nbsp; $35 each additional guest&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Late check out (subject to availability) for the couple and parents.&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Room upgrade (subject to availability upon arrival) for the couple and parents.&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;VIP Amenities in the room for the couple and parents.&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Professional Services of an Onsite Wedding Planner&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Romantic Ornamental decoration of the wedding site (location assigned after arrival).&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Standard wedding cake or variety of Chef\u00b4s customs pastry dessert choice&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Champagne Luxury Toast with Moet Chandon after the ceremony (max 4 bottles)&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Music for the marriage ceremony with recorded CD (couple may bring their own).&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Live Music (at the wedding ceremony or at a private wedding dinner*)&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Professional digital pictures of the Wedding full color photograph**. 15 Pictures&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Witnesses (if required)&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Bride\u2019s bouquet (Tropical Local Flowers)&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Groom\u2019s boutonniere&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Special fresh, elegant floral Decor on the Bridal Table&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;20% Discount on Spa Treatments (except pedicure, manicure, hairdresser and makeup).&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Sit-Down Wedding reception Dinner in one of our restaurants with set menu.&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Romantic decoration in couple room&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Luxury Turndown service for the couple and parents.&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Special welcome surprise&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Bottle of international wine upon arrival in room (just for the couple)&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Newlywed\u00b4s Romantic Breakfast in bed the morning after the wedding&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Romantic Candlelight Dinner with Reservation&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;VIP Treatment for the couple&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;\/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ROMANCE EXTRAVAGANZA -&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tulum &amp;amp; Coba -&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:small;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;$3,170 (Legal) $2,995 (Symbolic)&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Akumal &amp;amp; Sian Kaan -&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:small;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;$3,320 (Legal) $3,145 (Symbolic)&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;   - Maximum 30 people.&amp;nbsp; $40 each additional guest&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Late check out (subject to availability) for the couple and parents.&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Room upgrade (subject to availability upon arrival) for the couple and parents.&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;VIP Amenities in the room for the couple and parents.&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Professional Services of an Onsite Wedding Planner&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Romantic Ornamental decoration of the wedding site (location assigned after arrival).&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Standard wedding cake or variety of Chef\u00b4s customs pastry dessert choice&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Champagne Luxury Toast with Moet Chandon after the ceremony (max 7 bottles)&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Music for the marriage ceremony with recorded CD (couple may bring their own).&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Live Music (at the wedding ceremony or at a private wedding dinner*)&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Professional digital pictures of the Wedding full color photograph**. 25 Pictures&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Witnesses (if required)&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Manicure and pedicure for the bride&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Bride\u2019s bouquet (Tropical Local Flowers)&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Groom\u2019s boutonniere&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Special fresh, elegant floral Decor on the Bridal Table&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Cocktails and canapes served after the ceremony. (1 hour)&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Discount on Spa Treatments (except pedicure, manicure, hairdresser and makeup). Free 30 minute massage&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Sit-Down Wedding reception Dinner in one of our restaurants with set menu.&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Open bar after reception Dinner. (2 hours)&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Romantic decoration in couple room&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Luxury Turndown service for the couple and parents.&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Special welcome surprise&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Bottle of international wine upon arrival in room (just for the couple)&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Newlywed\u00b4s Romantic Breakfast in bed the morning after the wedding for the couple and parents.&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Romantic Candlelight Dinner with Reservation&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;VIP Treatment for the couple&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;3 Nights free \u2013 Special wedding present from Bahia Principe&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;\/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;MAYAN BLESSING - $1,150&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/786\/gran-bahia-principe-akumal-tulum-coba-post-here\/2250#post_1096080&#039;&gt;Post #2256&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;It is a traditional cultural ceremony where ancient Mayan blessed love of wedding couples in harmony of nature and with the authorization of the Gods, the 4 elements and the 7 spiritual directions, the smoke of copal cleans all souls and allows an eternal blessing of love, with the sound of the sea shells and the colors of the flowers. in this case the couple does not have to bring any legal documentation&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:27pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:symbol;\"&gt;\u00b7   &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:tahoma, sans-serif;\"&gt;Fees for the Religious Mayan Officer \u201cShaman\u201d\u2026&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:27pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:symbol;\"&gt;\u00b7   &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#333333;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:tahoma, sans-serif;\"&gt;Exclusive in Bahia Principe Riviera Maya &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:27pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:symbol;\"&gt;\u00b7   &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#333333;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:tahoma, sans-serif;\"&gt;Marriage ceremony with music of drums and seashells\u2026. Partly performed in Mayan language and translated into English&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:27pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:symbol;\"&gt;\u00b7   &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#333333;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:tahoma, sans-serif;\"&gt;Mayan Decoration of the location; the wedding location will be assigned after arrival.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:27pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:symbol;\"&gt;\u00b7   &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#333333;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:tahoma, sans-serif;\"&gt;Al the services of the package you choose \u2013 Romance Extravaganza, Unforgettable or Sunshine&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1514321,"PostDate":1314972872,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p><u><strong>Wedding Packages 2015<\/strong><\/u>.\u00a0 If you are sent a more up to date version, please PM me.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/786\/gran-bahia-principe-akumal-tulum-coba-post-here\/2330#post_1124798' class='bbc_url' title=''>Post #2333<\/a> has the Civil Ceremony Order<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>SUNSHINE - Tulum & Coba - $1,570 (Legal) $1,395 (Symbolic) Akumal\u00a0<\/strong><strong>& Sian Kaan<\/strong><strong>\u00a0-\u00a0<\/strong><strong>$1,690 (Legal) $1,515 (Symbolic)<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>- Winter 2014\/15 Maximum 20 people.\u00a0 $25 each additional guest<\/p>\n<ul><li>Late check out (subject to availability) for the couple and parents.<\/li>\n<li>Room upgrade (subject to availability upon arrival) for the couple and parents.<\/li>\n<li>VIP Amenities in the room.<\/li>\n<li>Professional Services of an Onsite Wedding Planner<\/li>\n<li>Romantic Ornamental decoration of the wedding site (location assigned after arrival).<\/li>\n<li>Standard wedding cake or variety of Chef\u00b4s customs pastry dessert choice<\/li>\n<li>Celebration Toast (Domestic Brand) after the ceremony .<\/li>\n<li>Music for the marriage ceremony with recorded CD (couple may bring their own).<\/li>\n<li>Professional digital pictures of the Wedding full color photograph**. 10 Pictures<\/li>\n<li>Witnesses (if required)<\/li>\n<li>Bride\u2019s bouquet (Tropical Local Flowers)<\/li>\n<li>Groom\u2019s boutonniere<\/li>\n<li>15% Discount on Spa Treatments (except pedicure, manicure, hairdresser and makeup).<\/li>\n<li>Sit-Down Wedding reception Dinner in one of our restaurants with set menu.<\/li>\n<li>Romantic decoration in couple room<\/li>\n<li>Luxury Turndown service for the couple and parents.<\/li>\n<li>Special welcome surprise<\/li>\n<li>Bottle of domestic wine upon arrival in room (just for the couple)<\/li>\n<li>Newlywed\u00b4s Romantic Breakfast in bed the morning after the wedding<\/li>\n<li>VIP Treatment for the couple<\/li>\n<\/ul><p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong><span  style=\"color:#333333\"><span  style=\"font-size:small\">UNFORGETTABLE\u00a0<\/span><\/span>Tulum & Coba -<\/strong><strong><span  style=\"color:#333333\"><span  style=\"font-size:small\">\u00a0$1,840 (Legal) $1,665 (Symbolic)\u00a0<\/span><\/span><\/strong><strong>Akumal & Sian Kaan -<\/strong><strong><span  style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51)\"><span  style=\"font-size:small\">\u00a0$1,990 (Legal) $1,815 (Symbolic)<\/span><\/span><\/strong><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0 \u00a0- Winter 2014\/15 Maximum 30 people.\u00a0 $35 each additional guest<\/p>\n<ul><li>Late check out (subject to availability) for the couple and parents.<\/li>\n<li>Room upgrade (subject to availability upon arrival) for the couple and parents.<\/li>\n<li>VIP Amenities in the room for the couple and parents.<\/li>\n<li>Professional Services of an Onsite Wedding Planner<\/li>\n<li>Romantic Ornamental decoration of the wedding site (location assigned after arrival).<\/li>\n<li>Standard wedding cake or variety of Chef\u00b4s customs pastry dessert choice<\/li>\n<li>Champagne Luxury Toast with Moet Chandon after the ceremony (max 4 bottles)<\/li>\n<li>Music for the marriage ceremony with recorded CD (couple may bring their own).<\/li>\n<li>Live Music (at the wedding ceremony or at a private wedding dinner*)<\/li>\n<li>Professional digital pictures of the Wedding full color photograph**. 15 Pictures<\/li>\n<li>Witnesses (if required)<\/li>\n<li>Bride\u2019s bouquet (Tropical Local Flowers)<\/li>\n<li>Groom\u2019s boutonniere<\/li>\n<li>Special fresh, elegant floral Decor on the Bridal Table<\/li>\n<li>20% Discount on Spa Treatments (except pedicure, manicure, hairdresser and makeup).<\/li>\n<li>Sit-Down Wedding reception Dinner in one of our restaurants with set menu.<\/li>\n<li>Romantic decoration in couple room<\/li>\n<li>Luxury Turndown service for the couple and parents.<\/li>\n<li>Special welcome surprise<\/li>\n<li>Bottle of international wine upon arrival in room (just for the couple)<\/li>\n<li>Newlywed\u00b4s Romantic Breakfast in bed the morning after the wedding<\/li>\n<li>Romantic Candlelight Dinner with Reservation<\/li>\n<li>VIP Treatment for the couple<\/li>\n<\/ul><p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>ROMANCE EXTRAVAGANZA -\u00a0<\/strong><strong>Tulum & Coba -<\/strong><strong><span  style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51)\"><span  style=\"font-size:small\">\u00a0$3,170 (Legal) $2,995 (Symbolic)\u00a0<\/span><\/span><\/strong><strong>Akumal & Sian Kaan -<\/strong><strong><span  style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51)\"><span  style=\"font-size:small\">\u00a0$3,320 (Legal) $3,145 (Symbolic)<\/span><\/span><\/strong><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0\u00a0 - Maximum 30 people.\u00a0 $40 each additional guest<\/p>\n<ul><li>Late check out (subject to availability) for the couple and parents.<\/li>\n<li>Room upgrade (subject to availability upon arrival) for the couple and parents.<\/li>\n<li>VIP Amenities in the room for the couple and parents.<\/li>\n<li>Professional Services of an Onsite Wedding Planner<\/li>\n<li>Romantic Ornamental decoration of the wedding site (location assigned after arrival).<\/li>\n<li>Standard wedding cake or variety of Chef\u00b4s customs pastry dessert choice<\/li>\n<li>Champagne Luxury Toast with Moet Chandon after the ceremony (max 7 bottles)<\/li>\n<li>Music for the marriage ceremony with recorded CD (couple may bring their own).<\/li>\n<li>Live Music (at the wedding ceremony or at a private wedding dinner*)<\/li>\n<li>Professional digital pictures of the Wedding full color photograph**. 25 Pictures<\/li>\n<li>Witnesses (if required)<\/li>\n<li>Manicure and pedicure for the bride<\/li>\n<li>Bride\u2019s bouquet (Tropical Local Flowers)<\/li>\n<li>Groom\u2019s boutonniere<\/li>\n<li>Special fresh, elegant floral Decor on the Bridal Table<\/li>\n<li>Cocktails and canapes served after the ceremony. (1 hour)<\/li>\n<li>Discount on Spa Treatments (except pedicure, manicure, hairdresser and makeup). Free 30 minute massage<\/li>\n<li>Sit-Down Wedding reception Dinner in one of our restaurants with set menu.<\/li>\n<li>Open bar after reception Dinner. (2 hours)<\/li>\n<li>Romantic decoration in couple room<\/li>\n<li>Luxury Turndown service for the couple and parents.<\/li>\n<li>Special welcome surprise<\/li>\n<li>Bottle of international wine upon arrival in room (just for the couple)<\/li>\n<li>Newlywed\u00b4s Romantic Breakfast in bed the morning after the wedding for the couple and parents.<\/li>\n<li>Romantic Candlelight Dinner with Reservation<\/li>\n<li>VIP Treatment for the couple<\/li>\n<li>3 Nights free \u2013 Special wedding present from Bahia Principe<\/li>\n<\/ul><p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>MAYAN BLESSING - $1,150<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/786\/gran-bahia-principe-akumal-tulum-coba-post-here\/2250#post_1096080' class='bbc_url' title=''>Post #2256<\/a><\/p>\n<p>It is a traditional cultural ceremony where ancient Mayan blessed love of wedding couples in harmony of nature and with the authorization of the Gods, the 4 elements and the 7 spiritual directions, the smoke of copal cleans all souls and allows an eternal blessing of love, with the sound of the sea shells and the colors of the flowers. in this case the couple does not have to bring any legal documentation<\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:27pt\"><span  style=\"font-family:symbol\">\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0 <\/span><span  style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51)\"><span  style=\"font-family:tahoma, sans-serif\">Fees for the Religious Mayan Officer \u201cShaman\u201d\u2026<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:27pt\"><span  style=\"font-family:symbol\">\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0 <\/span><span  style=\"color:#333333\"><span  style=\"font-family:tahoma, sans-serif\">Exclusive in Bahia Principe Riviera Maya <\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:27pt\"><span  style=\"font-family:symbol\">\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0 <\/span><span  style=\"color:#333333\"><span  style=\"font-family:tahoma, sans-serif\">Marriage ceremony with music of drums and seashells\u2026. Partly performed in Mayan language and translated into English<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:27pt\"><span  style=\"font-family:symbol\">\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0 <\/span><span  style=\"color:#333333\"><span  style=\"font-family:tahoma, sans-serif\">Mayan Decoration of the location; the wedding location will be assigned after arrival.<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:27pt\"><span  style=\"font-family:symbol\">\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0 <\/span><span  style=\"color:#333333\"><span  style=\"font-family:tahoma, sans-serif\">Al the services of the package you choose \u2013 Romance Extravaganza, Unforgettable or Sunshine<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"~Trisha~<br \/>\n<a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.faberphotography.com'>www.faberphotography.com<\/a><br \/>\n<br \/>\nMy latest destination wedding photos can be found <a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/faberphotography.com\/destination-wedding\/'>HERE<\/a>","Email":"tfaber@wbmi.com","IpAddress":"12.24.226.126","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1172009700,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207201.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Tlseege","Id":207201,"Name":"Tlseege","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":63282,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1435260821,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d5112b1e564e07cbd778bf9b7ec786ed","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WEDDING SITES&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/u&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tulum:&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Gazebo&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Palapa\/Beach Location:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Beach Location:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Just wanted to add that at this location you get the sunflower arrangements on both sides for free - if you don&#039;t like them, I&#039;m sure you can not have them. They are silk I believe (but I never did get a good look at them).&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Rain Option - Tequila Restaurant:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Akumal Locations:&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Garden:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Hammock\/Beach Location:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;This location has recently been changed to look like the Tulum Beach location. &amp;nbsp;A large new structure was built. &amp;nbsp;If you have pictures of this structure, please send them to me and I will add them to this file. &amp;nbsp;Thank you!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;These next two pictures show you the \"aisle\" you walk down:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Here is a picture of my wedding decorations (blue) and those similar.&amp;nbsp; As you can see, I brought down additional fabric.&amp;nbsp; &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/786\/gran-bahia-principe-akumal-tulum-coba-post-here\/4390#post_1638299&#039;&gt;Post #4394&lt;\/a&gt; talks about it.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1514323,"PostDate":1314972877,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p><u><strong>WEDDING SITES<\/strong><\/u><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>Tulum:<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>Gazebo<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1514323]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-207201-0-40764900-1394483687.jpg\" title=\"Gran Bahia Tulum Wedding Gazebo.jpg - Size: 104.39KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-207201-0-40764900-1394483687.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Gran Bahia Tulum Wedding Gazebo.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1514323]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-207201-0-09661600-1394483701.jpg\" title=\"Gran Bahia Tulum Wedding Gazebo v4.jpg - Size: 97.08KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-207201-0-09661600-1394483701.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Gran Bahia Tulum Wedding Gazebo v4.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1514323]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-207201-0-37724200-1394483711.jpg\" title=\"Gran Bahia Tulum Wedding Gazebo v5.jpg - Size: 104.37KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-207201-0-37724200-1394483711.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Gran Bahia Tulum Wedding Gazebo v5.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1514323]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-207201-0-27781600-1394482872.jpg\" title=\"Gran Bahia Tulum Wedding Gazebo v1.jpg - Size: 100.1KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-207201-0-27781600-1394482872.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Gran Bahia Tulum Wedding Gazebo v1.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1514323]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-207201-0-75137300-1394482883.jpg\" title=\"Gran Bahia Tulum Wedding Gazebo v2.jpg - Size: 59.24KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-207201-0-75137300-1394482883.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Gran Bahia Tulum Wedding Gazebo v2.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1514323]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-207201-0-42965200-1394482895.jpg\" title=\"Gran Bahia Tulum Wedding Gazebo v3.jpg - Size: 73.61KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-207201-0-42965200-1394482895.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Gran Bahia Tulum Wedding Gazebo v3.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1514323]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-207201-0-75016200-1394483721.jpg\" title=\"Gran Bahia Tulum Wedding Gazebo v6.jpg - Size: 162.15KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-207201-0-75016200-1394483721.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Gran Bahia Tulum Wedding Gazebo v6.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Palapa\/Beach Location:<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1514323]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-207201-0-79793200-1394483734.jpg\" title=\"Gran Bahia Tulum Beach Wedding v4.jpg - Size: 68.68KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-207201-0-79793200-1394483734.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Gran Bahia Tulum Beach Wedding v4.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1514323]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-207201-0-93628100-1394482911.jpg\" title=\"Gran Bahia Tulum Beach Wedding v1.jpg - Size: 9.32KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-207201-0-93628100-1394482911.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Gran Bahia Tulum Beach Wedding v1.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1514323]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-207201-0-95171300-1394482919.jpg\" title=\"Gran Bahia Tulum Beach Wedding v2.jpg - Size: 23.01KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-207201-0-95171300-1394482919.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Gran Bahia Tulum Beach Wedding v2.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1514323]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-207201-0-75166900-1394482928.jpg\" title=\"Gran Bahia Tulum Beach Wedding v3.jpg - Size: 196.5KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-207201-0-75166900-1394482928.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Gran Bahia Tulum Beach Wedding v3.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Beach Location:<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1514323]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_02_2015\/post-207201-0-52382500-1423949232.jpg\" title=\"Gran-Bahia-Principe-Tulum-Beach-Wedding-Location-v1.jpg - Size: 155.24KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_02_2015\/post-207201-0-52382500-1423949232.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Gran-Bahia-Principe-Tulum-Beach-Wedding-Location-v1.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1514323]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_02_2015\/post-207201-0-40530100-1423949253.jpg\" title=\"Gran-Bahia-Principe-Tulum-Beach-Wedding-Location-v2.jpg - Size: 160.88KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_02_2015\/post-207201-0-40530100-1423949253.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Gran-Bahia-Principe-Tulum-Beach-Wedding-Location-v2.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1514323]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_02_2015\/post-207201-0-65817100-1423949272.jpg\" title=\"Gran-Bahia-Principe-Tulum-Beach-Wedding-Location-v4.jpg - Size: 127.23KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_02_2015\/post-207201-0-65817100-1423949272.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Gran-Bahia-Principe-Tulum-Beach-Wedding-Location-v4.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1514323]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_02_2015\/post-207201-0-43381500-1423949282.jpg\" title=\"Gran-Bahia-Principe-Tulum-Beach-Wedding-Location-v5.jpg - Size: 149.87KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_02_2015\/post-207201-0-43381500-1423949282.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Gran-Bahia-Principe-Tulum-Beach-Wedding-Location-v5.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1514323]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_02_2015\/post-207201-0-82782400-1423949294.jpg\" title=\"Gran-Bahia-Principe-Tulum-Beach-Wedding-Location-v6.jpg - Size: 83.27KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_02_2015\/post-207201-0-82782400-1423949294.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Gran-Bahia-Principe-Tulum-Beach-Wedding-Location-v6.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1514323]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_02_2015\/post-207201-0-69817200-1423949303.jpg\" title=\"Gran-Bahia-Principe-Tulum-Beach-Wedding-Location-v7.jpg - Size: 133.31KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_02_2015\/post-207201-0-69817200-1423949303.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Gran-Bahia-Principe-Tulum-Beach-Wedding-Location-v7.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1514323]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_02_2015\/post-207201-0-91329800-1423949262.jpg\" title=\"Gran-Bahia-Principe-Tulum-Beach-Wedding-Location-v3.jpg - Size: 182.59KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_02_2015\/post-207201-0-91329800-1423949262.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Gran-Bahia-Principe-Tulum-Beach-Wedding-Location-v3.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1514323]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2015\/post-207201-0-33589900-1435260770.jpg\" title=\"Tulum Beach Front Wedding Location.jpg - Size: 115.62KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2015\/post-207201-0-33589900-1435260770.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Tulum Beach Front Wedding Location.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Just wanted to add that at this location you get the sunflower arrangements on both sides for free - if you don't like them, I'm sure you can not have them. They are silk I believe (but I never did get a good look at them).<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Rain Option - Tequila Restaurant:<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1514323]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-207201-0-26806300-1394483071.jpg\" title=\"Gran Bahia Tulum Rain Wedding Location v1.jpg - Size: 107.81KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-207201-0-26806300-1394483071.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Gran Bahia Tulum Rain Wedding Location v1.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1514323]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-207201-0-51703000-1394483095.jpg\" title=\"Gran Bahia Tulum Rain Wedding Location v2.jpg - Size: 110.43KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-207201-0-51703000-1394483095.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Gran Bahia Tulum Rain Wedding Location v2.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>Akumal Locations:<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>Garden:<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1514323]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-207201-0-12013500-1394483110.jpg\" title=\"Gran Bahia Akumal Garden Wedding v1.jpg - Size: 15.22KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-207201-0-12013500-1394483110.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Gran Bahia Akumal Garden Wedding v1.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1514323]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-207201-0-95250200-1394483120.jpg\" title=\"Gran Bahia Akumal Garden Wedding v2.jpg - Size: 14.33KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-207201-0-95250200-1394483120.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Gran Bahia Akumal Garden Wedding v2.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Hammock\/Beach Location:<\/p>\n<p>This location has recently been changed to look like the Tulum Beach location. \u00a0A large new structure was built. \u00a0If you have pictures of this structure, please send them to me and I will add them to this file. \u00a0Thank you!<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1514323]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-207201-0-99961200-1394483758.jpg\" title=\"Gran Bahia Akumal Beach Wedding v8.jpg - Size: 89.1KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-207201-0-99961200-1394483758.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Gran Bahia Akumal Beach Wedding v8.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1514323]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-207201-0-30072300-1394483195.jpg\" title=\"Gran Bahia Akumal Beach Wedding v1.jpg - Size: 58.03KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-207201-0-30072300-1394483195.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Gran Bahia Akumal Beach Wedding v1.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>These next two pictures show you the \"aisle\" you walk down:<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1514323]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-207201-0-47352300-1394483207.jpg\" title=\"Gran Bahia Akumal Beach Wedding v2.jpg - Size: 78.18KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-207201-0-47352300-1394483207.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Gran Bahia Akumal Beach Wedding v2.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1514323]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-207201-0-18656600-1394483239.jpg\" title=\"Gran Bahia Akumal Beach Wedding v3.jpg - Size: 160.83KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-207201-0-18656600-1394483239.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Gran Bahia Akumal Beach Wedding v3.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Here is a picture of my wedding decorations (blue) and those similar.\u00a0 As you can see, I brought down additional fabric.\u00a0 <a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/786\/gran-bahia-principe-akumal-tulum-coba-post-here\/4390#post_1638299' class='bbc_url' title=''>Post #4394<\/a> talks about it.<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1514323]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-207201-0-13049300-1394483354.jpg\" title=\"Gran Bahia Akumal Beach Wedding v5.jpg - Size: 163.3KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-207201-0-13049300-1394483354.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Gran Bahia Akumal Beach Wedding v5.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1514323]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-207201-0-65617400-1394483363.jpg\" title=\"Gran Bahia Akumal Beach Wedding v6.jpg - Size: 20.81KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-207201-0-65617400-1394483363.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Gran Bahia Akumal Beach Wedding v6.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1514323]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-207201-0-25442300-1394483372.jpg\" title=\"Gran Bahia Akumal Beach Wedding v7.jpg - Size: 64.82KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-207201-0-25442300-1394483372.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Gran Bahia Akumal Beach Wedding v7.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"~Trisha~<br \/>\n<a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.faberphotography.com'>www.faberphotography.com<\/a><br \/>\n<br \/>\nMy latest destination wedding photos can be found <a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/faberphotography.com\/destination-wedding\/'>HERE<\/a>","Email":"tfaber@wbmi.com","IpAddress":"12.24.226.126","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1172009700,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207201.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Tlseege","Id":207201,"Name":"Tlseege","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":63282,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1435260922,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0c921762748c880535c7fcf7ce5d9a43","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DINNER OPTIONS&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/u&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Menus for all restaurants can be viewed &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bahia-gourmet.com\/en\/losrestaurantes.htm&#039;&gt;here&lt;\/a&gt;.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;Tulum Dinner Options:&lt;\/u&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Tequila - Tables of 4, 8, or 10 - white linens&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Gran Torguta - Round and square tables (the round ones seat 6, the square seat 4).&amp;nbsp; Can be pushed together to have a table of 10.&amp;nbsp; White table clothes and little vases with flowers in them.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;Akumal Dinner Options:&lt;\/u&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Frutos Del Mar (Seafood) - 100 PAX&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Dolce Vita (Italian) - 100 PAX (the top picture is the new chairs, but the older pictures show the table arrangements a little better)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Arlequin&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;Coba Dinner Options:&lt;\/u&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Mediteraneo - 2 dishes guests can choose from are Linguine Pasta (vegetarian, and everyone thought it was delicious, including me!) and Lemon chicken, which our guests raved about!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Portifino&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/786\/gran-bahia-principe-akumal-tulum-coba-post-here\/2950#post_1313981&#039;&gt;Post #2960&lt;\/a&gt; and &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/786\/gran-bahia-principe-akumal-tulum-coba-post-here\/4410#post_1639879&#039;&gt;Post #4411&lt;\/a&gt; have additional information on the Portifino&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;Pool side dinner options&lt;\/u&gt;: - Round tables of 10&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/786\/gran-bahia-principe-akumal-tulum-coba-post-here\/1410#post_775910&#039;&gt;Post #1414&lt;\/a&gt; contains a video from a Tulum Pool Reception&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;These posts have additional information and the last two are Coba specific:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/786\/gran-bahia-principe-akumal-tulum-coba-post-here\/3030#post_1330032&#039;&gt;Post #3031&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/786\/gran-bahia-principe-akumal-tulum-coba-post-here\/3380#post_1475893&#039;&gt;Post #3383&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/786\/gran-bahia-principe-akumal-tulum-coba-post-here\/4220#post_1606339&#039;&gt;Post #4226&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/786\/gran-bahia-principe-akumal-tulum-coba-post-here\/4470#post_1652068&#039;&gt;Post #4478&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Poolside Dinner Pricing&lt;\/strong&gt;:&lt;\/u&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/786\/gran-bahia-principe-akumal-tulum-coba-post-here\/50#post_116092&#039;&gt;Post #55&lt;\/a&gt; includes the menus for all options&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;***Note: All the dinners include local drinks inside of the All inclusive program and have a maximum duration of two hours. It will be an extra charge for wine of the wine list and champagne.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Theme Dinners&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/u&gt; - Must pay for a minimum of 50 people&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Gala Dinner - $72 per person&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;BBQ Dinner - $46 per person&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Mexican Dinner - $46 per person&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Caribbean Dinner - $48 per person&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Additional Private Meals&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;\/u&gt;- Must pay for a minimum of 35 people&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Paella (seafood) - $20 per person&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Mixed Grill - $20 per person&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Taquiza (tacos) - $15 per person&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;American (hot dogs &amp;amp; hamburgers) - $12 per person\n\n***All of these meals will be served with disposable cutlery and dishes.&amp;nbsp; (although I had the mixed grill and it was on beautiful white china...)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lobster Dinner\/Special Luxury menu&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/u&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;At a specialty restaurant - $60 per person&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;At a location out of the restaurants - $100 per person&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;*** Additional cost for lobster inside the restaurant with the menu of the restaurant 35 USD per order.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Poolside Reception (Cocktails) Only Reception Prices:&lt;\/u&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Special Cocktails - Sparkling wine, Beer, Margaritas, Pina Colada - $5 per person for the first hour, $3 each additional&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;National Bar - Beer, Rum, Vodka, Tequila, Cocktails, Gin&amp;nbsp;- $17 per person for the first hour, $12 each additional&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;International Bar - Beer, Tequila, Rum, Vodka Absolute, Whiskey JW, Chivas, Regal, Cutty Sark, Cocktails, Gin Beef eaters - $24 per person for the first hour, $18 each additional&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;There is rumor and this one photo that you might be able to have your cocktail reception under the new Tulum beach location. &amp;nbsp;If anyone has had this option presented to them, please let me know so I can provide more information to the forum.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Poolside Reception (Cocktails and DJ or Music) Only Reception Prices:&lt;\/u&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:sans-serif;color:rgb(34,34,34);\"&gt;These options are for 30 persons maximum, in case there&#039;s more people will have an extra charge.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;\n&lt;span style=\"font-family:sans-serif;color:rgb(34,34,34);\"&gt;This packages includes 3 hours of open bar, set up, soft lighting, cocktail tables, Tiffany chairs, microphone, and music. (so this includes DJ).&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:Tahoma;color:rgb(34,34,34);\"&gt;&lt;b&gt;National Bar: &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/b&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;\n&lt;span style=\"font-family:Tahoma;color:rgb(34,34,34);\"&gt;Beer, Rum, Vodka, Tequila, Cocktails, Gin, Whiskey &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; \t\t\t $1900 USD &lt;\/span&gt;\n&lt;span style=\"font-family:Tahoma;color:rgb(34,34,34);\"&gt;&lt;b&gt;Special Cocktails:&lt;\/b&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;\n&lt;span style=\"font-family:Tahoma;color:rgb(34,34,34);\"&gt;Beer, PinaColada Cocktail, Margarita Cocktail &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:Tahoma;color:rgb(34,34,34);\"&gt;&amp;amp; Sparkling Wine   $1100 USD&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;\n&lt;span style=\"font-family:sans-serif;color:rgb(34,34,34);\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Special Cocktails&lt;\/strong&gt; without DJ but with Speakers so we can play our own music: 585 USD&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;strong&gt;50 Persons Poolside Reception&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/u&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;National Bar&lt;\/strong&gt;\n\nBeer, Rum, Vodka, Tequila, Cocktails, Gin, Whiskey &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; $2680\n\n&lt;b&gt;Special Cocktails&lt;\/b&gt;\n\nBeer, Pina Coladas, Margaritas, Sparkling Wine\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t$1400&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;This option &amp;nbsp;is for 50 persons maximum , in case there\u00b4s more people will have an extra charge.\n\nThis packages includes 3 hours of open bar, set up, soft lighting, cocktail tables, white tiffany chairs microphone and music DJ&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"&gt;ADDITIONAL SPARKLING WINE OR CHAMPAGNE&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/u&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"&gt;Domestic Sparkling Wine (price per bottle)\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"&gt;25.00 USD&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"&gt;Freixenet (price per bottle)\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t&amp;nbsp; &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"&gt;39.00 USD&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"&gt;Moet Chandon (price per bottle)\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t&amp;nbsp; &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"&gt;85.00 USD&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;strong&gt;MUSIC&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/u&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:.75in;\"&gt;Mexican Party with live show and Mariachi - &lt;strong&gt;$2,000 for 1 hour&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:.75in;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"&gt;Mexican Guitar Duet (set 45 minutes)\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t&amp;nbsp; &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"&gt;$272.00 USD&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:.75in;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"&gt;Mexican Guitar Trio (set 45 minutes)\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t  &amp;nbsp; &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"&gt;$295.00 USD&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:.75in;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"&gt;Mariachi (set 45 minutes) \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"&gt;$370.00 USD&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:.75in;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"&gt;Saxophonist (set 45 minutes)\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t  &amp;nbsp; &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"&gt;$390.00 USD&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:.75in;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"&gt;Marimba (set 45 minutes)\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t&amp;nbsp; &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"&gt;$325.00 USD&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:.75in;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"&gt;Live Band (set 45 minutes)&lt;strong&gt;\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t  &amp;nbsp; $999.00 USD&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:.75in;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"&gt;DJ (set 1 hour, only in private events)\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t  &amp;nbsp;   &amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;$211.00 USD&lt;\/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp; &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:.75in;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"&gt;Violin \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t&amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;$390.00 USD&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;*Private group entertainment (Olympic games, treasure hunt, etc) - $5 per person&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[{"Id":26916,"Name":"Frutos-Del-Mar-Restaurant-Inside.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-207201-0-90909000-1394481863.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-207201-0-90909000-1394481863_thumb.jpg","Width":800,"Height":532}],"Id":1514324,"PostDate":1314972882,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p><u><strong>DINNER OPTIONS<\/strong><\/u><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Menus for all restaurants can be viewed <a href='http:\/\/www.bahia-gourmet.com\/en\/losrestaurantes.htm' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>here<\/a>.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><u>Tulum Dinner Options:<\/u><\/p>\n<p>Tequila - Tables of 4, 8, or 10 - white linens<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1514324]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-207201-0-31326400-1394481474.jpg\" title=\"Tequila.jpg - Size: 92.14KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-207201-0-31326400-1394481474.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Tequila.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Gran Torguta - Round and square tables (the round ones seat 6, the square seat 4).\u00a0 Can be pushed together to have a table of 10.\u00a0 White table clothes and little vases with flowers in them.<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1514324]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_02_2015\/post-207201-0-27996000-1423949383.jpg\" title=\"Gran-Bahia-Principe-Tulum-Gran-Tortuga-Restaurant.jpg - Size: 134.11KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_02_2015\/post-207201-0-27996000-1423949383.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Gran-Bahia-Principe-Tulum-Gran-Tortuga-Restaurant.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1514324]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_02_2015\/post-207201-0-51006400-1423949392.jpg\" title=\"Gran-Bahia-Principe-Tulum-Gran-Tortuga-Restaurant-v2.jpg - Size: 180.84KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_02_2015\/post-207201-0-51006400-1423949392.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Gran-Bahia-Principe-Tulum-Gran-Tortuga-Restaurant-v2.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><u>Akumal Dinner Options:<\/u><\/p>\n<p>Frutos Del Mar (Seafood) - 100 PAX<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1514324]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_02_2015\/post-207201-0-00748900-1423949450.jpg\" title=\"Gran-Bahia-Principe-Akumal-Frutos-Del-Mar.jpg - Size: 118.19KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_02_2015\/post-207201-0-00748900-1423949450.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Gran-Bahia-Principe-Akumal-Frutos-Del-Mar.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1514324]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_02_2015\/post-207201-0-19648500-1423949459.jpg\" title=\"Gran-Bahia-Principe-Akumal-Frutos-Del-Mar-v2.jpg - Size: 185.14KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_02_2015\/post-207201-0-19648500-1423949459.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Gran-Bahia-Principe-Akumal-Frutos-Del-Mar-v2.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Dolce Vita (Italian) - 100 PAX (the top picture is the new chairs, but the older pictures show the table arrangements a little better)<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1514324]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_02_2015\/post-207201-0-61951600-1423949485.jpg\" title=\"Gran-Bahia-Principe-Akumal-v1.jpg - Size: 135.45KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_02_2015\/post-207201-0-61951600-1423949485.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Gran-Bahia-Principe-Akumal-v1.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1514324]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-207201-0-88739900-1394481490.jpg\" title=\"Dolce Vita v1.jpg - Size: 185.47KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-207201-0-88739900-1394481490.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Dolce Vita v1.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1514324]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-207201-0-39434500-1394481503.jpg\" title=\"Dolce Vita v2.jpg - Size: 189.26KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-207201-0-39434500-1394481503.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Dolce Vita v2.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1514324]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-207201-0-42900500-1394481885.jpg\" title=\"Dolce-Vita-Restaurant-Table.jpg - Size: 160.88KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-207201-0-42900500-1394481885.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Dolce-Vita-Restaurant-Table.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p>Arlequin<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1514324]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-207201-0-33622000-1394481926.jpg\" title=\"Arlequin-Restaurant-Inside.jpg - Size: 122.82KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-207201-0-33622000-1394481926.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Arlequin-Restaurant-Inside.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><u>Coba Dinner Options:<\/u><\/p>\n<p>Mediteraneo - 2 dishes guests can choose from are Linguine Pasta (vegetarian, and everyone thought it was delicious, including me!) and Lemon chicken, which our guests raved about!<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1514324]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-207201-0-85554300-1394481965.jpg\" title=\"Mediterraneo-Restaurant-Inside.jpg - Size: 157.86KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-207201-0-85554300-1394481965.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Mediterraneo-Restaurant-Inside.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Portifino<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1514324]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-207201-0-78985500-1394481518.jpg\" title=\"Portifino v1.jpg - Size: 21.16KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-207201-0-78985500-1394481518.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Portifino v1.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1514324]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-207201-0-45697500-1394481989.jpg\" title=\"Portofino-Restaurant-Inside.jpg - Size: 163.86KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-207201-0-45697500-1394481989.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Portofino-Restaurant-Inside.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/786\/gran-bahia-principe-akumal-tulum-coba-post-here\/2950#post_1313981' class='bbc_url' title=''>Post #2960<\/a> and <a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/786\/gran-bahia-principe-akumal-tulum-coba-post-here\/4410#post_1639879' class='bbc_url' title=''>Post #4411<\/a> have additional information on the Portifino<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><u>Pool side dinner options<\/u>: - Round tables of 10<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1514324]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-207201-0-69637500-1394481534.jpg\" title=\"Poolside Reception v1.jpg - Size: 27.2KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-207201-0-69637500-1394481534.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Poolside Reception v1.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1514324]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-207201-0-60785500-1394481545.jpg\" title=\"Poolside Reception v2.jpg - Size: 18.04KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-207201-0-60785500-1394481545.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Poolside Reception v2.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1514324]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-207201-0-70749100-1394481558.jpg\" title=\"Poolside Reception v3.jpg - Size: 44.64KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-207201-0-70749100-1394481558.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Poolside Reception v3.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1514324]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-207201-0-58660100-1394481580.jpg\" title=\"Riviera-Maya-Destination-Wedding-Photographer-Faber-Photography-v5.jpg - Size: 109.86KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-207201-0-58660100-1394481580.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Riviera-Maya-Destination-Wedding-Photographer-Faber-Photography-v5.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1514324]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-207201-0-21364800-1394482024.jpg\" title=\"Coba-Jacuzzi-Pool-Wedding-Setup-2.jpg - Size: 159.96KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-207201-0-21364800-1394482024.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Coba-Jacuzzi-Pool-Wedding-Setup-2.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1514324]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-207201-0-38359000-1394482229.jpg\" title=\"Coba Poolside Reception v1.jpg - Size: 115.97KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-207201-0-38359000-1394482229.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Coba Poolside Reception v1.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1514324]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-207201-0-04630900-1394482243.jpg\" title=\"Coba Poolside Reception v2.jpg - Size: 127.66KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-207201-0-04630900-1394482243.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Coba Poolside Reception v2.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1514324]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-207201-0-37237300-1394482254.jpg\" title=\"Tulum Poolside Reception.jpg - Size: 128.24KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-207201-0-37237300-1394482254.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Tulum Poolside Reception.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/786\/gran-bahia-principe-akumal-tulum-coba-post-here\/1410#post_775910' class='bbc_url' title=''>Post #1414<\/a> contains a video from a Tulum Pool Reception<\/p>\n<p>These posts have additional information and the last two are Coba specific:<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/786\/gran-bahia-principe-akumal-tulum-coba-post-here\/3030#post_1330032' class='bbc_url' title=''>Post #3031<\/a><\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/786\/gran-bahia-principe-akumal-tulum-coba-post-here\/3380#post_1475893' class='bbc_url' title=''>Post #3383<\/a><\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/786\/gran-bahia-principe-akumal-tulum-coba-post-here\/4220#post_1606339' class='bbc_url' title=''>Post #4226<\/a><\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/786\/gran-bahia-principe-akumal-tulum-coba-post-here\/4470#post_1652068' class='bbc_url' title=''>Post #4478<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><u><strong>Poolside Dinner Pricing<\/strong>:<\/u><\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/786\/gran-bahia-principe-akumal-tulum-coba-post-here\/50#post_116092' class='bbc_url' title=''>Post #55<\/a> includes the menus for all options<\/p>\n<p>***Note: All the dinners include local drinks inside of the All inclusive program and have a maximum duration of two hours. It will be an extra charge for wine of the wine list and champagne.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><u><strong>Theme Dinners<\/strong><\/u> - Must pay for a minimum of 50 people<\/p>\n<p>Gala Dinner - $72 per person<\/p>\n<p>BBQ Dinner - $46 per person<\/p>\n<p>Mexican Dinner - $46 per person<\/p>\n<p>Caribbean Dinner - $48 per person<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><u><strong>Additional Private Meals<\/strong> <\/u>- Must pay for a minimum of 35 people<\/p>\n<p>Paella (seafood) - $20 per person<\/p>\n<p>Mixed Grill - $20 per person<\/p>\n<p>Taquiza (tacos) - $15 per person<\/p>\n<p>American (hot dogs & hamburgers) - $12 per person<br>\n***All of these meals will be served with disposable cutlery and dishes.\u00a0 (although I had the mixed grill and it was on beautiful white china...)<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><u><strong>Lobster Dinner\/Special Luxury menu<\/strong><\/u><\/p>\n<p>At a specialty restaurant - $60 per person<\/p>\n<p>At a location out of the restaurants - $100 per person<\/p>\n<p>*** Additional cost for lobster inside the restaurant with the menu of the restaurant 35 USD per order.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong><u>Poolside Reception (Cocktails) Only Reception Prices:<\/u><\/strong><\/p>\n<p>Special Cocktails - Sparkling wine, Beer, Margaritas, Pina Colada - $5 per person for the first hour, $3 each additional<\/p>\n<p>National Bar - Beer, Rum, Vodka, Tequila, Cocktails, Gin\u00a0- $17 per person for the first hour, $12 each additional<\/p>\n<p>International Bar - Beer, Tequila, Rum, Vodka Absolute, Whiskey JW, Chivas, Regal, Cutty Sark, Cocktails, Gin Beef eaters - $24 per person for the first hour, $18 each additional<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>There is rumor and this one photo that you might be able to have your cocktail reception under the new Tulum beach location. \u00a0If anyone has had this option presented to them, please let me know so I can provide more information to the forum.<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1514324]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2015\/post-207201-0-57102500-1435260910.jpg\" title=\"Tulum Beach Front Cocktail Setup.jpg - Size: 62.6KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2015\/post-207201-0-57102500-1435260910.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Tulum Beach Front Cocktail Setup.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong><u>Poolside Reception (Cocktails and DJ or Music) Only Reception Prices:<\/u><\/strong><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-family:sans-serif;color:rgb(34,34,34)\">These options are for 30 persons maximum, in case there's more people will have an extra charge.\u00a0<\/span><br><span  style=\"font-family:sans-serif;color:rgb(34,34,34)\">This packages includes 3 hours of open bar, set up, soft lighting, cocktail tables, Tiffany chairs, microphone, and music. (so this includes DJ).<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-family:Tahoma;color:rgb(34,34,34)\"><b>National Bar: \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<\/b><\/span><span  style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:arial, sans-serif\">\u00a0<\/span><br><span  style=\"font-family:Tahoma;color:rgb(34,34,34)\">Beer, Rum, Vodka, Tequila, Cocktails, Gin, Whiskey \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 $1900 USD <\/span><br><span  style=\"font-family:Tahoma;color:rgb(34,34,34)\"><b>Special Cocktails:<\/b><\/span><span  style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:arial, sans-serif\">\u00a0<\/span><br><span  style=\"font-family:Tahoma;color:rgb(34,34,34)\">Beer, PinaColada Cocktail, Margarita Cocktail <\/span><span  style=\"font-family:Tahoma;color:rgb(34,34,34)\">& Sparkling Wine\u00a0\u00a0 $1100 USD<\/span><span  style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:arial, sans-serif\">\u00a0<\/span><br><span  style=\"font-family:sans-serif;color:rgb(34,34,34)\"><strong>Special Cocktails<\/strong> without DJ but with Speakers so we can play our own music: 585 USD<\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><u><strong>50 Persons Poolside Reception<\/strong><\/u><\/p>\n<p><strong>National Bar<\/strong><br>\nBeer, Rum, Vodka, Tequila, Cocktails, Gin, Whiskey \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 $2680<br><br><b>Special Cocktails<\/b><br>\nBeer, Pina Coladas, Margaritas, Sparkling Wine\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0$1400<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>This option \u00a0is for 50 persons maximum , in case there\u00b4s more people will have an extra charge.<br>\nThis packages includes 3 hours of open bar, set up, soft lighting, cocktail tables, white tiffany chairs microphone and music DJ<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong><u><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:11pt\">ADDITIONAL SPARKLING WINE OR CHAMPAGNE<\/span><\/span><\/u><\/strong><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:11pt\">Domestic Sparkling Wine (price per bottle)\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <\/span><\/span><strong><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:11pt\">25.00 USD<\/span><\/span><\/strong><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:11pt\">Freixenet (price per bottle)\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <\/span><\/span><strong><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:11pt\">39.00 USD<\/span><\/span><\/strong><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:11pt\">Moet Chandon (price per bottle)\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <\/span><\/span><strong><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:11pt\">85.00 USD<\/span><\/span><\/strong><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><u><strong>MUSIC<\/strong><\/u><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:.75in\">Mexican Party with live show and Mariachi - <strong>$2,000 for 1 hour<\/strong><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:.75in\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:11pt\">Mexican Guitar Duet (set 45 minutes)\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a