:1172009700,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207201.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Tlseege","Id":207201,"Name":"Tlseege","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":63282,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d3a09cb8876658f8cd1788cd818b9252","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; &lt;strong&gt;MMM CAKE&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Cake options&amp;nbsp;are round, 3 tiered round, and heart shaped. These are the cakes the come with the packages and are said to only feed 10 people.&amp;nbsp; You can skip dessert with your included dinner reception and upgrade your cake for free.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; We chose the tres leche (3 milk cake) and it was really good. Our family and friends enjoyed it too. It was moist and creamy and tasted like it was fresh out the oven. The only thing we didn&#039;t like was the fondant, but it wouldn&#039;t be a wedding cake if it didn&#039;t have that on top. Just peel it away and eat the good stuff. :-)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"Gran Bahia Riviera Maya Wedding Cake Options v1\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/532690\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"Gran Bahia Riviera Maya Wedding Cake Options v2\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/532692\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"Gran Bahia Riviera Maya Wedding Cake Options v3\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/532694\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"Gran Bahia Riviera Maya Wedding Cake Options v4\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/532696\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"Gran Bahia Riviera Maya Wedding Cake Options v5\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/532698\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"Gran Bahia Riviera Maya Wedding Cake Options v6\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/532701\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"Gran Bahia Riviera Maya Wedding Cake Options v8\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/532703\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"Gran Bahia Riviera Maya Wedding Cake Options v9\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/532705\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"Gran Bahia Riviera Maya Wedding Cake Options v10\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/532714\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"Gran Bahia Riviera Maya Wedding Cake Options v11\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/532716\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"Gran Bahia Riviera Maya Wedding Cake Options v12\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/532718\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1514326,"PostDate":1314972895,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> <strong>MMM CAKE<\/strong><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Cake options\u00a0are round, 3 tiered round, and heart shaped. These are the cakes the come with the packages and are said to only feed 10 people.\u00a0 You can skip dessert with your included dinner reception and upgrade your cake for free.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> We chose the tres leche (3 milk cake) and it was really good. Our family and friends enjoyed it too. It was moist and creamy and tasted like it was fresh out the oven. The only thing we didn't like was the fondant, but it wouldn't be a wedding cake if it didn't have that on top. Just peel it away and eat the good stuff. :-)<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Gran Bahia Riviera Maya Wedding Cake Options v1\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/532690\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Gran Bahia Riviera Maya Wedding Cake Options v2\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/532692\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Gran Bahia Riviera Maya Wedding Cake Options v3\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/532694\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Gran Bahia Riviera Maya Wedding Cake Options v4\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/532696\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Gran Bahia Riviera Maya Wedding Cake Options v5\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/532698\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Gran Bahia Riviera Maya Wedding Cake Options v6\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/532701\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Gran Bahia Riviera Maya Wedding Cake Options v8\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/532703\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Gran Bahia Riviera Maya Wedding Cake Options v9\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/532705\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Gran Bahia Riviera Maya Wedding Cake Options v10\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/532714\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Gran Bahia Riviera Maya Wedding Cake Options v11\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/532716\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Gran Bahia Riviera Maya Wedding Cake Options v12\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/532718\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"~Trisha~<br \/>\n<a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.faberphotography.com'>www.faberphotography.com<\/a><br \/>\n<br \/>\nMy latest destination wedding photos can be found <a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/faberphotography.com\/destination-wedding\/'>HERE<\/a>","Email":"tfaber@wbmi.com","IpAddress":"12.24.226.126","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1172009700,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207201.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Tlseege","Id":207201,"Name":"Tlseege","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":63282,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7cddb16ba959116b4c2490752daca67d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; &lt;u&gt;&lt;strong&gt;RANDOM DETAILS&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/u&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Chair covers &amp;amp; white sashes are included for the ceremony&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Maracas are for sale at the Hacienda for $1-2 each&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Vegetarian meals are available at no extra charge&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Dress steaming is available - $15-25&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; $250 to rent the equipment to play a slideshow&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"225743000042409260_De651eVp_c.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/834872\/width\/554\/height\/368\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"225743000042409261_F2cWEoJK_c.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/834870\/width\/554\/height\/367\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"225743000042409266_nbYENs3X_c.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/834868\/width\/426\/height\/640\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1514327,"PostDate":1314972900,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> <u><strong>RANDOM DETAILS<\/strong><\/u><\/p> <p> Chair covers & white sashes are included for the ceremony<\/p> <p> Maracas are for sale at the Hacienda for $1-2 each<\/p> <p> Vegetarian meals are available at no extra charge<\/p> <p> Dress steaming is available - $15-25<\/p> <p> $250 to rent the equipment to play a slideshow<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"225743000042409260_De651eVp_c.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/834872\/width\/554\/height\/368\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"225743000042409261_F2cWEoJK_c.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/834870\/width\/554\/height\/367\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"225743000042409266_nbYENs3X_c.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/834868\/width\/426\/height\/640\" \/><\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"~Trisha~<br \/>\n<a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.faberphotography.com'>www.faberphotography.com<\/a><br \/>\n<br \/>\nMy latest destination wedding photos can be found <a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/faberphotography.com\/destination-wedding\/'>HERE<\/a>","Email":"tfaber@wbmi.com","IpAddress":"12.24.226.126","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1172009700,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207201.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Tlseege","Id":207201,"Name":"Tlseege","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":63282,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1394482436,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"42a404c6925ac96edf4041a35f87aaf3","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;strong&gt;FLOWERS&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/u&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Here is the flower document.&amp;nbsp; I appoligize that it has to be in attachment form, but it&#039;s too large to place otherwise.&amp;nbsp; PLEASE remember it is \"illegal\" on this forum to ask for people to email you things.&amp;nbsp; You can get banned for this.&amp;nbsp; Please just contribute to different threads to get above the 150 post mark and then download it legally or purchase the upgrade to download immediately.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;These are not the ONLY flowers you can get.&amp;nbsp; As long as you provide a picture of what you want and it incorporates the types of flowers you see in these brochures, it should be included.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;You can email your coordinator a picture of the flowers you want and they should be able to recreate them.&amp;nbsp; If they have exotic flowers in them such as orchids then it&#039;ll cost you extra.&amp;nbsp; Roses\/Lilies\/etc are included in your wedding package price.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;You can bring your own flower ribbon &amp;amp; pins and they will use that.&amp;nbsp; Otherwise white is included.&amp;nbsp; You can also request to not have the huge white bow that is pictured in most of the images in the catalog.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:40px;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:40px;\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"&gt;EXTRA FLOWERS&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/u&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"&gt; &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"&gt;-&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"&gt; &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;Prices depend on type of flowers and size. &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:40px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"&gt;$36 Bridesmaids bouquets &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:40px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"&gt;$15 Boutonniere &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:40px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"&gt;$25 Bracelet of flowers &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:40px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"&gt;$18 Corsage &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:40px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"&gt;$6&amp;nbsp; Lilies or gerbers for the hair &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:40px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"&gt;$40 Centerpieces &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:40px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"&gt;$10 Bag of petals for decoration of tables or aisle&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:40px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"&gt;$25 Flowers for the cake &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:40px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"&gt;$6   Flower for decoration of the chairs&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Here are some posts about flowers:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/786\/gran-bahia-principe-akumal-tulum-coba-post-here\/980#post_605852&#039;&gt;Post #983&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/786\/gran-bahia-principe-akumal-tulum-coba-post-here\/980#post_606839&#039;&gt;Post #986&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/786\/gran-bahia-principe-akumal-tulum-coba-post-here\/1050#post_632494&#039;&gt;Post #1057&lt;\/a&gt; - Flower Brochures again&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/786\/gran-bahia-principe-akumal-tulum-coba-post-here\/1670#post_913439&#039;&gt;Post #1675&lt;\/a&gt; - Flower price list 2009&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/786\/gran-bahia-principe-akumal-tulum-coba-post-here\/1880#post_994474&#039;&gt;Post #1884&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/786\/gran-bahia-principe-akumal-tulum-coba-post-here\/1890#post_998437&#039;&gt;Post #1891&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/786\/gran-bahia-principe-akumal-tulum-coba-post-here\/2810#post_1273589&#039;&gt;Post #2819 &lt;\/a&gt;- Wrist Corsages&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/786\/gran-bahia-principe-akumal-tulum-coba-post-here\/3090#post_1343388&#039;&gt;Post #3092&lt;\/a&gt; - Budget breakdown &amp;amp; pictures&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/786\/gran-bahia-principe-akumal-tulum-coba-post-here\/3090#post_1343798&#039;&gt;Post #3094&lt;\/a&gt; - Budget breakdown &amp;amp; pictures&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/786\/gran-bahia-principe-akumal-tulum-coba-post-here\/4560#post_1665128&#039;&gt;Post #4566&lt;\/a&gt; - My bridal flowers (Included)&amp;nbsp;&amp;amp; Bridesmaid flowers ($38 each)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1514328,"PostDate":1314972906,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p><u><strong>FLOWERS<\/strong><\/u><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Here is the flower document.\u00a0 I appoligize that it has to be in attachment form, but it's too large to place otherwise.\u00a0 PLEASE remember it is \"illegal\" on this forum to ask for people to email you things.\u00a0 You can get banned for this.\u00a0 Please just contribute to different threads to get above the 150 post mark and then download it legally or purchase the upgrade to download immediately.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpapp=core&amp;module=attach&amp;section=attach&amp;attach_id=26906\" title=\"Download attachment\"><img src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/public\/style_extra\/mime_types\/doc.gif\" alt=\"Attached File\" \/><\/a>\n&nbsp;<a href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpapp=core&amp;module=attach&amp;section=attach&amp;attach_id=26906\" title=\"Download attachment\"><strong>Gran Bahia Flowers 1.doc<\/strong><\/a> &nbsp;&nbsp;<span class='desc'><strong>3.82MB<\/strong><\/span>\n&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class=\"desc lighter\">60 downloads<\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpapp=core&amp;module=attach&amp;section=attach&amp;attach_id=26907\" title=\"Download attachment\"><img src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/public\/style_extra\/mime_types\/doc.gif\" alt=\"Attached File\" \/><\/a>\n&nbsp;<a href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpapp=core&amp;module=attach&amp;section=attach&amp;attach_id=26907\" title=\"Download attachment\"><strong>Gran Bahia Flowers 2.doc<\/strong><\/a> &nbsp;&nbsp;<span class='desc'><strong>1.49MB<\/strong><\/span>\n&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class=\"desc lighter\">38 downloads<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span>\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>These are not the ONLY flowers you can get.\u00a0 As long as you provide a picture of what you want and it incorporates the types of flowers you see in these brochures, it should be included.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>You can email your coordinator a picture of the flowers you want and they should be able to recreate them.\u00a0 If they have exotic flowers in them such as orchids then it'll cost you extra.\u00a0 Roses\/Lilies\/etc are included in your wedding package price.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>You can bring your own flower ribbon & pins and they will use that.\u00a0 Otherwise white is included.\u00a0 You can also request to not have the huge white bow that is pictured in most of the images in the catalog.<\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:40px\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:40px\"><strong><u><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:11pt\">EXTRA FLOWERS<\/span><\/span><\/u><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:11pt\"> <\/span><\/span><\/strong><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:11pt\">-<strong><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:11pt\"> <\/span><\/span><\/strong>Prices depend on type of flowers and size. <\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:40px\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:11pt\">$36 Bridesmaids bouquets <\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:40px\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:11pt\">$15 Boutonniere <\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:40px\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:11pt\">$25 Bracelet of flowers <\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:40px\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:11pt\">$18 Corsage <\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:40px\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:11pt\">$6\u00a0 Lilies or gerbers for the hair <\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:40px\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:11pt\">$40 Centerpieces <\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:40px\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:11pt\">$10 Bag of petals for decoration of tables or aisle<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:40px\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:11pt\">$25 Flowers for the cake <\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:40px\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:11pt\">$6\u00a0\u00a0 Flower for decoration of the chairs<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Here are some posts about flowers:<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/786\/gran-bahia-principe-akumal-tulum-coba-post-here\/980#post_605852' class='bbc_url' title=''>Post #983<\/a><\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/786\/gran-bahia-principe-akumal-tulum-coba-post-here\/980#post_606839' class='bbc_url' title=''>Post #986<\/a><\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/786\/gran-bahia-principe-akumal-tulum-coba-post-here\/1050#post_632494' class='bbc_url' title=''>Post #1057<\/a> - Flower Brochures again<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/786\/gran-bahia-principe-akumal-tulum-coba-post-here\/1670#post_913439' class='bbc_url' title=''>Post #1675<\/a> - Flower price list 2009<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/786\/gran-bahia-principe-akumal-tulum-coba-post-here\/1880#post_994474' class='bbc_url' title=''>Post #1884<\/a><\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/786\/gran-bahia-principe-akumal-tulum-coba-post-here\/1890#post_998437' class='bbc_url' title=''>Post #1891<\/a><\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/786\/gran-bahia-principe-akumal-tulum-coba-post-here\/2810#post_1273589' class='bbc_url' title=''>Post #2819 <\/a>- Wrist Corsages<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/786\/gran-bahia-principe-akumal-tulum-coba-post-here\/3090#post_1343388' class='bbc_url' title=''>Post #3092<\/a> - Budget breakdown & pictures<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/786\/gran-bahia-principe-akumal-tulum-coba-post-here\/3090#post_1343798' class='bbc_url' title=''>Post #3094<\/a> - Budget breakdown & pictures<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/786\/gran-bahia-principe-akumal-tulum-coba-post-here\/4560#post_1665128' class='bbc_url' title=''>Post #4566<\/a> - My bridal flowers (Included)\u00a0& Bridesmaid flowers ($38 each)<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"~Trisha~<br \/>\n<a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.faberphotography.com'>www.faberphotography.com<\/a><br \/>\n<br \/>\nMy latest destination wedding photos can be found <a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/faberphotography.com\/destination-wedding\/'>HERE<\/a>","Email":"tfaber@wbmi.com","IpAddress":"12.24.226.126","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1172009700,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207201.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Tlseege","Id":207201,"Name":"Tlseege","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":63282,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1435263927,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b2b2989f110ee04055bb30d7bdc404ac","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;strong&gt;BAHIA SPA&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/u&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Spa Info Posts:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/786\/gran-bahia-principe-akumal-tulum-coba-post-here\/30#post_101633&#039;&gt;Post #35&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/786\/gran-bahia-principe-akumal-tulum-coba-post-here\/880#post_575006&#039;&gt;Post #883&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/786\/gran-bahia-principe-akumal-tulum-coba-post-here\/1400#post_774724&#039;&gt;Post #1406&lt;\/a&gt; - 2009 Prices&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/786\/gran-bahia-principe-akumal-tulum-coba-post-here\/2460#post_1162731&#039;&gt;Post #2461&lt;\/a&gt; - 2010 Prices&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Here&amp;nbsp;are the current 2015 prices&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Non Package Prices:&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Bridal Hair (includes a trial 1 or 2 days before the wedding) - $95&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Wedding Make-up - $65&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Fake Eyelashes - $15&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Bride Hair &amp;amp; Makeup - $160&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Bridesmaid Hair (trial NOT included) - $85&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Bridesmaid Hair &amp;amp; Makeup - $145&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;50 minute Caribbean Relaxing massage - $100 USD&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Passion Fruit Manicure - $40&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Spa Manicure&amp;nbsp;- $50&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Passion Fruit&amp;nbsp;Pedicure - $50&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Spa Pedicure&amp;nbsp;- $60&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Passion Fruit Mani &amp;amp; Pedi package - $90&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Spa Mani &amp;amp; Pedi package - $99&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SPA PACKAGES&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Romantic Caribbean Sunset: $376 USD&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;- Day 1:&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/strong&gt;Bridal Style Trial (included) + Pack passion fruit Manicure and Pedicure + Groom\u2019s Hair Cut&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;- Day 2:&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/strong&gt;Bridal Styling and Make up&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;- Day 3:&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/strong&gt;Couple\u2019s Relaxing Caribbean Massage for 50 min, Enjoy a Romantic Caribbean Sunset at the Beach area&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Summer Fantasy: $531&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;- Day 1:&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/strong&gt;Bridal Style Trial (included) + Pack Mani\/Pedi BahiaSpa + Ultra Moisturizing Facial Treatment + Groom\u2019s Haircut&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;- Day 2:&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/strong&gt;Bridal Styling and Make up&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;- Day 3:&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/strong&gt;V.I.P. Special Couple\u2019s Massage, decorated with flowers, candles and aromatherapy&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;For her: Relaxing Caribbean Massage (50 Min) with Bamboo&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;For him: Deep Tissue Massage (50 Min)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Emails:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;mailto:spabpcob@bahia-principe.com&#039;&gt;spabpcob@bahia-principe.com&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;mailto:spabpaku@bahia-principe.com&#039;&gt;spabpaku@bahia-principe.com&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;mailto:spabptul@bahia-principe.com&#039;&gt;spabptul@bahia-principe.com&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;The spa is open everyday from 8am - 8pm&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Testimonials:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/786\/gran-bahia-principe-akumal-tulum-coba-post-here\/820#post_548750&#039;&gt;Post #823&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/786\/gran-bahia-principe-akumal-tulum-coba-post-here\/820#post_549973&#039;&gt;Post #828&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/786\/gran-bahia-principe-akumal-tulum-coba-post-here\/940#post_594611&#039;&gt;Post #941&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/786\/gran-bahia-principe-akumal-tulum-coba-post-here\/960#post_602668&#039;&gt;Post #963&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/786\/gran-bahia-principe-akumal-tulum-coba-post-here\/990#post_610029&#039;&gt;Post #995&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/786\/gran-bahia-principe-akumal-tulum-coba-post-here\/1490#post_810851&#039;&gt;Post #1491&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/786\/gran-bahia-principe-akumal-tulum-coba-post-here\/3030#post_1330308&#039;&gt;Post #3034&lt;\/a&gt; - Just okay&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/786\/gran-bahia-principe-akumal-tulum-coba-post-here\/3490#post_1501060&#039;&gt;Post #3500&lt;\/a&gt; - &amp;amp; Pictures&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1514329,"PostDate":1314972912,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p><u><strong>BAHIA SPA<\/strong><\/u><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Spa Info Posts:<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/786\/gran-bahia-principe-akumal-tulum-coba-post-here\/30#post_101633' class='bbc_url' title=''>Post #35<\/a><\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/786\/gran-bahia-principe-akumal-tulum-coba-post-here\/880#post_575006' class='bbc_url' title=''>Post #883<\/a><\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/786\/gran-bahia-principe-akumal-tulum-coba-post-here\/1400#post_774724' class='bbc_url' title=''>Post #1406<\/a> - 2009 Prices<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/786\/gran-bahia-principe-akumal-tulum-coba-post-here\/2460#post_1162731' class='bbc_url' title=''>Post #2461<\/a> - 2010 Prices<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>Here\u00a0are the current 2015 prices<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Non Package Prices:\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Bridal Hair (includes a trial 1 or 2 days before the wedding) - $95<\/p>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<p>Wedding Make-up - $65<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0 \u00a0Fake Eyelashes - $15<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Bride Hair & Makeup - $160<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Bridesmaid Hair (trial NOT included) - $85<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Bridesmaid Hair & Makeup - $145<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>50 minute Caribbean Relaxing massage - $100 USD<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Passion Fruit Manicure - $40<\/p>\n<p>Spa Manicure\u00a0- $50<\/p>\n<p>Passion Fruit\u00a0Pedicure - $50<\/p>\n<p>Spa Pedicure\u00a0- $60<\/p>\n<p>Passion Fruit Mani & Pedi package - $90<\/p>\n<p>Spa Mani & Pedi package - $99<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>SPA PACKAGES<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>Romantic Caribbean Sunset: $376 USD<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><strong>- Day 1:\u00a0<\/strong>Bridal Style Trial (included) + Pack passion fruit Manicure and Pedicure + Groom\u2019s Hair Cut<\/p>\n<p><strong>- Day 2:\u00a0<\/strong>Bridal Styling and Make up<\/p>\n<p><strong>- Day 3:\u00a0<\/strong>Couple\u2019s Relaxing Caribbean Massage for 50 min, Enjoy a Romantic Caribbean Sunset at the Beach area<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>Summer Fantasy: $531<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><strong>- Day 1:\u00a0<\/strong>Bridal Style Trial (included) + Pack Mani\/Pedi BahiaSpa + Ultra Moisturizing Facial Treatment + Groom\u2019s Haircut<\/p>\n<p><strong>- Day 2:\u00a0<\/strong>Bridal Styling and Make up<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>- Day 3:\u00a0<\/strong>V.I.P. Special Couple\u2019s Massage, decorated with flowers, candles and aromatherapy<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0For her: Relaxing Caribbean Massage (50 Min) with Bamboo<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0For him: Deep Tissue Massage (50 Min)<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Emails:<\/p>\n<p><a href='mailto:spabpcob@bahia-principe.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>spabpcob@bahia-principe.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p><a href='mailto:spabpaku@bahia-principe.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>spabpaku@bahia-principe.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p><a href='mailto:spabptul@bahia-principe.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>spabptul@bahia-principe.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>The spa is open everyday from 8am - 8pm<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Testimonials:<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/786\/gran-bahia-principe-akumal-tulum-coba-post-here\/820#post_548750' class='bbc_url' title=''>Post #823<\/a><\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/786\/gran-bahia-principe-akumal-tulum-coba-post-here\/820#post_549973' class='bbc_url' title=''>Post #828<\/a><\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/786\/gran-bahia-principe-akumal-tulum-coba-post-here\/940#post_594611' class='bbc_url' title=''>Post #941<\/a><\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/786\/gran-bahia-principe-akumal-tulum-coba-post-here\/960#post_602668' class='bbc_url' title=''>Post #963<\/a><\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/786\/gran-bahia-principe-akumal-tulum-coba-post-here\/990#post_610029' class='bbc_url' title=''>Post #995<\/a><\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/786\/gran-bahia-principe-akumal-tulum-coba-post-here\/