ation -&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;4 hours of coverage $900 USD&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DIAMOND&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/strong&gt;-&amp;nbsp;Bride&#039;s Getting Ready, Ceremony, Cocktail &amp;amp; Photo Session with Family and Friends, Groom &amp;amp; Bride&#039;s Photo Session at the Beach &amp;amp; at Second Location, Dinner &amp;amp; Cake -&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5 hours of coverage $1,000 USD&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;LUXURY&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/strong&gt;-&amp;nbsp;Bride&#039;s Getting Ready, Ceremony, Cocktail &amp;amp; Photo Session with Family and Friends, Groom &amp;amp; Bride&#039;s Photo Session at the Beach &amp;amp; at Second Location, Dinner, Cake, &amp;amp; Speeches -&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;6 hours of coverage $1,150 USD&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;JADE&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/strong&gt;-&amp;nbsp;Bride&#039;s Getting Ready, Ceremony, Cocktail &amp;amp; Photo Session with Family and Friends, Groom &amp;amp; Bride&#039;s Photo Session at the Beach &amp;amp; at Second Location, Dinner, Cake, Speeches, Reception (1st Dance, Bouquet, &amp;amp; Party) - &lt;strong&gt;7 hours of coverage&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;$1,300 USD&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;FULL&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/strong&gt;-&amp;nbsp;Bride&#039;s Getting Ready, Ceremony, Cocktail &amp;amp; Photo Session with Family and Friends, Groom &amp;amp; Bride&#039;s Photo Session at the Beach &amp;amp; at Second Location, Dinner, Cake, Speeches, Reception (1st Dance, Bouquet, &amp;amp; Party), Trash the Dress (next day after the wedding) -&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;8 hou