  <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>You <strong>DO NOT<\/strong> have to hire <span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:11pt\">Tropic One Studio<\/span><\/span> to capture the memories of your wedding.\u00a0 You are allowed to fly in a photographer.\u00a0 If you do this, they have to stay for 5 nights.\u00a0 Make sure your photographer knows this when providing you a quote.\u00a0 I HIGHLY recommend you fly in your own photographer.\u00a0 Your day will be better captured with professional equipment, more coverage, more images delivered, and a professional will be devoted to YOU.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><u><strong><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:11pt\">Tropic One Studio<\/span><\/span><\/strong><\/u> - Onsite Photographers<\/p>\n<p>Most brides\u00a0spend on average $2000-3000 on their services for 150-200 pictures<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span  style=\"color:#000000\">Ms. Roc\u00edo De Prado who is the Photo Manager for WEG (Wedding, Events & Groups). <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:.25in\"><span  style=\"color:#000000\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:11pt\">Email: <strong><a href='mailto:rocio.deprado@%5Bmember=' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>rocio.deprado@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"275336\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/275336-tropiconestudio\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Tropiconestudio<\/span><\/a>.com<\/a>\u00a0 <\/strong><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:.25in\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:.25in\"><strong><span  style=\"color:#000000\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:11pt\">To see their\u00a0pictures you can go on Facebook: <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/strong><a href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/tropiconestudiomexico?ref=br_tf' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:11pt\">Tropic ONE Studio Mexico<\/span><\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>Included pictures of your CEREMONY<\/strong>: Romance Extravaganza - 25 photos | Unforgettable - 15 photos | Sunshine - 10 photos | Mayan - 5 photos<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>PHOTO PACKAGES:<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><strong>EXTRA<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>- Ceremony,Cocktail & Photo Session with Family and Friends, Groom & Bride\u00b4s Photo Session at the Beach -\u00a0<strong>1 hour 30 photos $400<\/strong> <strong>USD<\/strong><br>\n\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>BASIC<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>- Bride's Getting Ready, Ceremony, Cocktail & Photo Session with Family and Friends, Groom & Bride's Photo Session at the Beach -\u00a0<strong>2 hours 50 photos $750 USD<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>SILVER<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>-\u00a0Bride's Getting Ready, Ceremony, Cocktail & Photo Session with Family and Friends, Groom & Bride's Photo Session at the Beach & at Second Location -\u00a0<strong>3 hours 80 photos $1,100 USD<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>GOLDEN<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>-\u00a0Bride's Getting Ready, Ceremony, Cocktail & Photo Session with Family and Friends, Groom & Bride's Photo Session at the Beach & at Second Location -\u00a0<strong>4 hours 110 photos $1,450 USD<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>DIAMOND<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><strong>\u00a0<\/strong>-\u00a0Bride's Getting Ready, Ceremony, Cocktail & Photo Session with Family and Friends, Groom & Bride's Photo Session at the Beach & at Second Location, Dinner & Cake -<strong> 5 hours 130 photos $1,800 USD<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>LUXURY<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><strong>\u00a0<\/strong>-\u00a0Bride's Getting Ready, Ceremony, Cocktail & Photo Session with Family and Friends, Groom & Bride's Photo Session at the Beach & at Second Location, Dinner, Cake, & Speeches -\u00a0<strong>6 hours 155 photos $2,150 USD<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>JADE<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><strong>\u00a0<\/strong>-\u00a0Bride's Getting Ready, Ceremony, Cocktail & Photo Session with Family and Friends, Groom & Bride's Photo Session at the Beach & at Second Location, Dinner, Cake, Speeches, Reception (1st Dance, Bouquet, & Party) -\u00a0<strong>7 hours 180 photos $2,500 USD<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>FULL<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><strong>\u00a0<\/strong>-\u00a0Bride's Getting Ready, Ceremony, Cocktail & Photo Session with Family and Friends, Groom & Bride's Photo Session at the Beach & at Second Location, Dinner, Cake, Speeches, Reception (1st Dance, Bouquet, & Party), Trash the Dress (next day after the wedding) -\u00a0<strong>8 hours 220 photos $2,850 USD<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Options for 2nd Location: Beach among sand or rocks, Gardens, Deck and Jumping into Water, Hacienda Dona Isabel with Mexican Colorful Style, Professional Photo Studio<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>VIDEO PACKAGES:<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><strong>EXTRA<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>- Ceremony,Cocktail & Photo Session with Family and Friends, Groom & Bride\u00b4s Photo Session at the Beach -\u00a0<strong>1 hour of Coverage $450 USD<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>BASIC<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>- Bride's Getting Ready, Ceremony, Cocktail & Photo Session with Family and Friends, Groom & Bride's Photo Session at the Beach -\u00a0<strong>2 hours of coverage $600 USD<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><