{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"72.209.228.111","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79603,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1442774098,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4bd58cf1679e0434c401e68ba8699967","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hello beautiful brides!\n\n\nI wanted to start a forum to share wedding information about the Cancun resorts managed by Playa Resorts.\n\n\nI&#039;ve booked my April 2016 wedding at the Hyatt Ziva opening in Cancun November 2015. It is formerly the Dreams Cancun resort.\n\n&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Here is a photo of one of the wedding venues available at Hyatt Ziva and the Hyatt wedding brochure. I think the venue is going to be gorgeous!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I look forward to chatting with other Playa brides!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1905073,"PostDate":1442774045,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hello beautiful brides!<br><br>\nI wanted to start a forum to share wedding information about the Cancun resorts managed by Playa Resorts.<br><br>\nI've booked my April 2016 wedding at the Hyatt Ziva opening in Cancun November 2015. It is formerly the Dreams Cancun resort.<br>\n\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Here is a photo of one of the wedding venues available at Hyatt Ziva and the Hyatt wedding brochure. I think the venue is going to be gorgeous!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I look forward to chatting with other Playa brides!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1905073]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_09_2015\/post-262240-0-63686100-1442769946.jpg\" title=\"RENDER GAZEBOHyatt cancun.jpg -  82.24KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_09_2015\/post-262240-0-63686100-1442769946.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"RENDER GAZEBOHyatt cancun.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<a href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpapp=core&amp;module=attach&amp;section=attach&amp;attach_id=33838\" title=\"\"><img src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/public\/style_extra\/mime_types\/pdf.gif\" alt=\"\" \/><\/a>\n&nbsp;<a href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpapp=core&amp;module=attach&amp;section=attach&amp;attach_id=33838\" title=\"\"><strong>Hyatt Weddings Brochure- FINAL.pdf<\/strong><\/a> &nbsp;&nbsp;<span class='desc'><strong>1.06MB<\/strong><\/span>\n&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class=\"desc lighter\">5 <\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"Amaqt03@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"98.169.122.6","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1352514105,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-262240.jpg?_r=1421980656","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MissAmber26","Id":262240,"Name":"MissAmber26","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"190.167.84.73","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79603,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c940e0672b8709b9b8465cf09526151d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;That&#039;s a great photo, MissAmber26! Looks like you&#039;ve chosen well for your wedding venue :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We captured a wedding at Dreams Cancun which was also gorgeous.....as you can see in these magical wedding moments that matter taken from that album - with a link here: &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10151184994994487.470938.18683524486&amp;amp;type=3&#039;&gt;Dreams Cancun Wedding Album&lt;\/a&gt;......enjoy!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-mia1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-ash2\/t31.0-8\/620901_10151184998434487_1492783092_o.jpg\" alt=\"620901_10151184998434487_1492783092_o.jp\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-mia1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-frc3\/t31.0-8\/664976_10151185001329487_1425881690_o.jpg\" alt=\"664976_10151185001329487_1425881690_o.jp\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-mia1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xfp1\/t31.0-8\/175004_10151185005534487_1695418387_o.jpg\" alt=\"175004_10151185005534487_1695418387_o.jp\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Wishing you happy research and all the best with your plans - cheers!!! team MTM :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1905187,"PostDate":1442940152,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>That's a great photo, MissAmber26! Looks like you've chosen well for your wedding venue <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We captured a wedding at Dreams Cancun which was also gorgeous.....as you can see in these magical wedding moments that matter taken from that album - with a link here: <a href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10151184994994487.470938.18683524486&type=3' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Dreams Cancun Wedding Album<\/a>......enjoy!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-mia1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-ash2\/t31.0-8\/620901_10151184998434487_1492783092_o.jpg\" alt=\"620901_10151184998434487_1492783092_o.jp\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-mia1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-frc3\/t31.0-8\/664976_10151185001329487_1425881690_o.jpg\" alt=\"664976_10151185001329487_1425881690_o.jp\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-mia1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xfp1\/t31.0-8\/175004_10151185005534487_1695418387_o.jpg\" alt=\"175004_10151185005534487_1695418387_o.jp\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wishing you happy research and all the best with your plans - cheers!!! team MTM <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><img src=\"http:\/\/i711.photobucket.com\/albums\/ww116\/momentsthatmatter\/MTMLogo08-1.png\" alt=\"MTMLogo08-1.png\"><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com'><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Moments That Matter Photography Studios, Playa del Carmen, Mexico<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>Canadian Award Winning Photojournalist serving Mayan Riviera<br>\nEmail: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com'>contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Scoop on what we do:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/r\/4212-beautiful-november-wedding\/#review'>MTM Reviews<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Meet Lincoln & Team MTM: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/vimeo.com\/51032621'>\"Meet Lincoln\" Video + see his Passion!!!<\/a>","Email":"momentsthatmatterphotography@gmail.com","IpAddress":"189.221.252.187","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1280214260,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230711.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Moments That Matter","Id":230711,"Name":"Moments That Matter","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.192.209.33","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79603,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"eb03e7dc0d7ab5a482b0f06ff5a95024","RawContent":"Hello!\n\nI will have about 50 guests. The venues I chose hold 50-60 people but I think they have other options for larger groups. I&#039;d suggest contacting them.\n\nTheir rates are online at Hyatt.com. My group block rates are the same as the ones online (grand opening special). \n\nGood luck!\n\n\n[quote name=\"wmac\" post=\"1906878\" timestamp=\"1446001491\"]\nThe resort looks beautiful!!  How many guests will you have. I am helping a bride plan a wedding and we are considering this resort.  I am waiting to see what the room rates will be.  We will have about 100 people.\n[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1906896,"PostDate":1446035433,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hello!<br><br>\nI will have about 50 guests. The venues I chose hold 50-60 people but I think they have other options for larger groups. I'd suggest contacting them.<br><br>\nTheir rates are online at Hyatt.com. My group block rates are the same as the ones online (grand opening special). <br><br>\nGood luck!<br><br><br><p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>wmac, on 27 October 2015 - 08:04 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>The resort looks beautiful!!\u00a0 How many guests will you have. I am helping a bride plan a wedding and we are considering this resort.\u00a0 I am waiting to see what the room rates will be.\u00a0 We will have about 100 people.<br><\/p><\/div><\/div>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"Amaqt03@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"98.169.122.6","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1352514105,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-262240.jpg?_r=1421980656","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MissAmber26","Id":262240,"Name":"MissAmber26","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":3,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
